window.CURRICULUM = [{"id":"P01","module":"M0","title":"Bias + GELU 融合","subtitle":"从全局线性下标走到寄存器 tile","difficulty":"入门","minutes":25,"tags":["Elementwise","Fusion","Broadcast","Bandwidth"],"statement":"给定行主序矩阵 X 和按列广播的 Bias，逐元素执行加法与 tanh 近似 GELU。把两步融合到一次 GPU 启动中，中间值不落到全局内存。先写可处理尾块的线性版本，再理解每个 block 处理一行中连续列的版本。","formula":"v = X[m,n] + Bias[n]; Y[m,n] = 0.5v · (1 + tanh(0.7978845608 · (v + 0.044715v³)))","inputs":"X: [M,N] float32、连续 row-major；Bias: [N] float32。题目规模 M=N=4096。","outputs":"Y: [M,N] float32，与输入位于同一 CUDA 设备。","constraints":["M、N 均为正整数；三个输入输出缓冲区不能相互别名。","V0 支持非整除形状，显式保护尾部。","V1 限定 N%1024==0、float32 连续张量；4096×4096 满足该条件。","采用题给 tanh 近似；不能拿 erf 版本作为相同公式的参考。","教学脚本已做 Python 语法检查；当前环境没有 TileLang / PyTorch，未进行 GPU 编译、正确性运行或性能测量。"],"approach":["V0 将 M×N 个位置展平；tile 内元素偏移 i 与 block 编号 bx 共同确定 idx。Bias 索引始终使用 idx%N。","V1 使用二维 grid：一维选择行，一维选择 1024 列。X、Bias 和输出 tile 都放入 fragment，完成计算后统一写回。","BLOCK 表示元素数，threads 表示线程数。1024 个元素由 256 个线程合作处理，i 不是线程编号。","以读 X 和写 Y 的 8MN 字节作为题目约定的有效数据量；Bias 的缓存流量与实际 DRAM 事务另算。tanh 的代价和启动开销仍需实测。"],"mapping":[{"cuda":"blockIdx.x*blockDim.x+threadIdx.x","tilelang":"bx*BLOCK+i","why":"把逻辑元素范围写成 tile，编译器负责分配给线程。"},{"cuda":"x[idx]+b[idx%N]","tilelang":"X[idx]+Bias[idx%N]","why":"广播是索引语义，展平后仍然要按列取 Bias。"},{"cuda":"float4 / 每线程多个元素","tilelang":"fragment + T.copy(..., coalesced_width=4)","why":"给出连续访问提示；是否生成 128-bit 指令要检查生成源码。"}],"versions":[{"name":"V0 · 线性 tile，显式尾部保护","note":"最接近 CUDA 基线，适合先核对索引。BLOCK 可与线程数不同。教学脚本已做 Python 语法检查；当前环境没有 TileLang / PyTorch，未进行 GPU 编译、正确性运行或性能测量。","code":"# Python 语法已检查；未在 GPU 上验证。\nimport torch\nimport tilelang\nimport tilelang.language as T\n\n\ndef make_gelu_bias(M, N, BLOCK=256):\n    assert M > 0 and N > 0\n\n    @T.prim_func\n    def main(\n        X: T.Tensor((M * N,), \"float32\"),\n        Bias: T.Tensor((N,), \"float32\"),\n        Y: T.Tensor((M * N,), \"float32\"),\n    ):\n        with T.Kernel(T.ceildiv(M * N, BLOCK), threads=256) as bx:\n            for i in T.Parallel(BLOCK):\n                idx = bx * BLOCK + i\n                if idx < M * N:\n                    v = X[idx] + Bias[idx % N]\n                    u = 0.7978845608 * (v + 0.044715 * v * v * v)\n                    Y[idx] = 0.5 * v * (1.0 + T.tanh(u))\n\n    # 不设置 out_idx：调用者显式传入输出缓冲区。\n    return tilelang.compile(main, target=\"cuda\")\n\n\ndef main():\n    torch.manual_seed(0)\n    # 同时覆盖题目尺寸与非整除尾部。\n    for M, N in [(4096, 4096), (7, 513)]:\n        x = torch.randn(M, N, device=\"cuda\", dtype=torch.float32)\n        bias = torch.randn(N, device=\"cuda\", dtype=torch.float32)\n        y = torch.empty_like(x)\n        kernel = make_gelu_bias(M, N)\n        kernel(x.view(-1), bias, y.view(-1))\n        v = x + bias\n        ref = 0.5 * v * (1.0 + torch.tanh(\n            0.7978845608 * (v + 0.044715 * v * v * v)))\n        torch.testing.assert_close(y, ref, rtol=1e-5, atol=1e-5)\n    print(\"GELU bias reference checks passed\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"},{"name":"V1 · 连续列 fragment","note":"限定 N 为 BLOCK 的倍数，减少教学代码中的尾部干扰。coalesced_width 是编译提示，不是带宽保证。教学脚本已做 Python 语法检查；当前环境没有 TileLang / PyTorch，未进行 GPU 编译、正确性运行或性能测量。","code":"# Python 语法已检查；未在 GPU 上验证。\nimport torch\nimport tilelang\nimport tilelang.language as T\n\n\ndef make_gelu_bias(M, N, BLOCK=1024):\n    assert M > 0 and N % BLOCK == 0\n    assert BLOCK % (256 * 4) == 0\n\n    @T.prim_func\n    def main(\n        X: T.Tensor((M, N), \"float32\"),\n        Bias: T.Tensor((N,), \"float32\"),\n        Y: T.Tensor((M, N), \"float32\"),\n    ):\n        with T.Kernel(N // BLOCK, M, threads=256) as (bx, row):\n            x = T.alloc_fragment((BLOCK,), \"float32\")\n            b = T.alloc_fragment((BLOCK,), \"float32\")\n            y = T.alloc_fragment((BLOCK,), \"float32\")\n            col0 = bx * BLOCK\n            T.copy(X[row, col0], x, coalesced_width=4)\n            T.copy(Bias[col0], b, coalesced_width=4)\n            for i in T.Parallel(BLOCK):\n                v = x[i] + b[i]\n                u = 0.7978845608 * (v + 0.044715 * v * v * v)\n                y[i] = 0.5 * v * (1.0 + T.tanh(u))\n            T.copy(y, Y[row, col0], coalesced_width=4)\n\n    return tilelang.compile(main, target=\"cuda\")\n\n\ndef main():\n    torch.manual_seed(0)\n    M = N = 4096\n    x = torch.randn(M, N, device=\"cuda\", dtype=torch.float32)\n    b = torch.randn(N, device=\"cuda\", dtype=torch.float32)\n    y = torch.empty_like(x)\n    kernel = make_gelu_bias(M, N)\n    kernel(x, b, y)\n    v = x + b\n    ref = 0.5 * v * (1.0 + torch.tanh(\n        0.7978845608 * (v + 0.044715 * v * v * v)))\n    torch.testing.assert_close(y, ref, rtol=1e-5, atol=1e-5)\n    # 可检查 kernel.get_kernel_source() 中的访存与寄存器使用。\n    print(\"GELU bias reference check passed\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"}],"pitfalls":[{"title":"混淆 GELU 定义","body":"PyTorch 的默认 GELU 使用 erf 形式。这里按题给 tanh 多项式构造参考，避免把定义差异当成精度错误。"},{"title":"把 tile 下标当线程号","body":"T.Parallel(1024) 代表 1024 个逻辑元素，不代表创建 1024 个线程。线程块的大小由 threads=256 指定。"},{"title":"仅凭数据量宣布 memory-bound","body":"8MN 是有效带宽口径；实际吞吐还受 tanh、寄存器占用、缓存和启动时间影响。没有实测就不能声称接近峰值。"}],"questions":[{"q":"为什么按行分 tile 后不再需要取模？","a":"row 与 col0 已独立给出行列坐标，Bias 直接读取同一个列 tile。"},{"q":"是否需要共享内存暂存 Bias？","a":"本实现中每个 block 只用一次该 Bias tile，共享内存会增加复制和同步；跨行复用能否受益应结合缓存与 tile 设计测量。"},{"q":"如何计算题目约定的有效带宽？","a":"BW=8MN/秒。M=N=4096 时有效字节为 128 MiB；时间必须用预热后的 GPU 计时。"}],"checklist":["核对 tanh 近似与常数。","用非整除 M、N 验证 V0 尾部。","检查 V1 的整除、连续性和对齐前提。","编译和输入分配放到性能计时之外。"],"blanks":[{"prompt":"展平后的列号 col = ____。","answer":"idx % N","hint":"一行有 N 个连续元素。"},{"prompt":"1024 个元素、256 个线程，平均每线程负责 ____ 个元素。","answer":"4","hint":"逻辑 tile 大小除以线程数；具体映射仍由编译器决定。"}],"references":[{"label":"TileLang 官方：逐元素算子与 tile 到线程的映射","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/docs/deeplearning_operators/elementwise.md"},{"label":"TileLang 官方：指令、访存与同步","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/docs/programming_guides/instructions.md"},{"label":"TileLang 官方源码：compile 与输出参数","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/tilelang/jit/__init__.py"}]},{"id":"P02","module":"M0","title":"矩阵转置","subtitle":"让输入与输出都沿连续方向访问","difficulty":"入门","minutes":30,"tags":["Transpose","Shared memory","Coalescing","Layout"],"statement":"把连续行主序矩阵 X[M,N] 转为独立、连续的 Y[N,M]，满足 Y[n,m]=X[m,n]。先写直接索引版本，再用共享内存改变 tile 的访问方向。这里实现物理转置，输出不是只修改 stride 的视图。","formula":"Y[n,m] = X[m,n]","inputs":"X: [M,N] float32，连续 row-major。","outputs":"Y: [N,M] float32，独立连续缓冲区。","constraints":["M、N>0，支持非 32 倍数的边缘 tile。","输入输出不得别名；本题不处理原地转置。","共享内存版本使用两个 32×32 float32 tile，共 8 KiB 逻辑存储，不含编译器可能增加的空间。","教学脚本已做 Python 语法检查；当前环境没有 TileLang / PyTorch，未进行 GPU 编译、正确性运行或性能测量。"],"approach":["直接版本写明输入与输出的下标交换，作为数值基线。行主序下，同时让两侧都按连续地址访问需要重新分配数据。","共享内存版本把 32×32 输入 tile 载入 smem，再用 T.transpose 转到另一个共享 tile，最后按输出行的连续方向写回。","输入、输出的边界分别由它们的全局坐标判断。转置同时交换 tile 内索引和 tile 的全局起点。","默认编译流程为跨线程共享内存依赖插入同步。进一步使用自定义布局处理 bank 冲突前，应先确认生成代码与性能瓶颈。"],"mapping":[{"cuda":"tile[ty][tx] 再读 tile[tx][ty]","tilelang":"T.transpose(src_shared, dst_shared)","why":"表达 tile 内重排，随后可采用适合输出的线程映射。"},{"cuda":"grid 按输入 tile 划分","tilelang":"T.Kernel(ceildiv(N,32),ceildiv(M,32))","why":"bx 沿输入列，by 沿输入行；输出起点为 (bx*32,by*32)。"},{"cuda":"__syncthreads()","tilelang":"默认 ThreadSync pass","why":"共同写入共享内存后，跨线程消费必须建立可见性。"}],"versions":[{"name":"V0 · 直接索引","note":"以最少结构核对坐标；读写中至少一侧的连续性受线程布局制约，不保证高性能。教学脚本已做 Python 语法检查；当前环境没有 TileLang / PyTorch，未进行 GPU 编译、正确性运行或性能测量。","code":"# Python 语法已检查；未在 GPU 上验证。\nimport torch\nimport tilelang\nimport tilelang.language as T\n\n\ndef make_transpose(M, N, TILE=32):\n    assert M > 0 and N > 0\n\n    @T.prim_func\n    def main(\n        X: T.Tensor((M, N), \"float32\"),\n        Y: T.Tensor((N, M), \"float32\"),\n    ):\n        with T.Kernel(\n            T.ceildiv(N, TILE), T.ceildiv(M, TILE), threads=256\n        ) as (bx, by):\n            for i, j in T.Parallel(TILE, TILE):\n                row = by * TILE + i\n                col = bx * TILE + j\n                if row < M and col < N:\n                    Y[col, row] = X[row, col]\n\n    return tilelang.compile(main, target=\"cuda\")\n\n\ndef main():\n    # 矩形、边缘和整齐尺寸都进入同一套验证流程。\n    for M, N in [(37, 65), (257, 129), (1024, 2048)]:\n        x = torch.arange(M * N, device=\"cuda\", dtype=torch.float32)\n        x = x.reshape(M, N)\n        y = torch.empty(N, M, device=\"cuda\", dtype=torch.float32)\n        kernel = make_transpose(M, N)\n        kernel(x, y)\n        ref = x.t().contiguous()\n        torch.testing.assert_close(y, ref, rtol=0, atol=0)\n        assert y.is_contiguous()\n    print(\"Transpose reference checks passed\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"},{"name":"V1 · 共享内存重排","note":"使用官方 T.transpose 处理二维共享 tile。Bank conflict 与布局需通过生成代码和 profiler 验证。教学脚本已做 Python 语法检查；当前环境没有 TileLang / PyTorch，未进行 GPU 编译、正确性运行或性能测量。","code":"# Python 语法已检查；未在 GPU 上验证。\nimport torch\nimport tilelang\nimport tilelang.language as T\n\n\ndef make_transpose(M, N, TILE=32):\n    assert M > 0 and N > 0\n\n    @T.prim_func\n    def main(\n        X: T.Tensor((M, N), \"float32\"),\n        Y: T.Tensor((N, M), \"float32\"),\n    ):\n        with T.Kernel(\n            T.ceildiv(N, TILE), T.ceildiv(M, TILE), threads=256\n        ) as (bx, by):\n            src = T.alloc_shared((TILE, TILE), \"float32\")\n            dst = T.alloc_shared((TILE, TILE), \"float32\")\n            # 所有 src 元素都定义；边缘位置补零。\n            for i, j in T.Parallel(TILE, TILE):\n                row = by * TILE + i\n                col = bx * TILE + j\n                if row < M and col < N:\n                    src[i, j] = X[row, col]\n                else:\n                    src[i, j] = 0.0\n            # dst[j,i] = src[i,j]，默认流程负责共享内存同步。\n            T.transpose(src, dst)\n            for i, j in T.Parallel(TILE, TILE):\n                out_row = bx * TILE + i\n                out_col = by * TILE + j\n                if out_row < N and out_col < M:\n                    Y[out_row, out_col] = dst[i, j]\n\n    return tilelang.compile(main, target=\"cuda\")\n\n\ndef main():\n    for M, N in [(37, 65), (257, 129), (1024, 2048)]:\n        x = torch.randn(M, N, device=\"cuda\", dtype=torch.float32)\n        y = torch.empty(N, M, device=\"cuda\", dtype=torch.float32)\n        kernel = make_transpose(M, N)\n        kernel(x, y)\n        torch.testing.assert_close(y, x.t().contiguous(), rtol=0, atol=0)\n    print(\"Shared transpose reference checks passed\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"}],"pitfalls":[{"title":"只交换 tile 内坐标","body":"tile 的全局行列起点也必须交换。仅把 src[i,j] 换成 src[j,i] 会把数据放到错误的大块。"},{"title":"共享内存不自动等于无冲突","body":"本版本没有强行声明达到最优布局。共享数组的物理布局、线程映射和 bank 冲突都要通过编译产物与 profiling 评估。"},{"title":"把转置视图当作物理转置","body":"x.t() 通常只改变张量 stride。参考加 contiguous() 才与独立连续输出的契约相同。"}],"questions":[{"q":"为什么选择矩形输入做测试？","a":"方阵容易掩盖行列起点交换错误；37×65 还会同时覆盖两个方向的边缘。"},{"q":"两块共享 tile 是最省内存的方案吗？","a":"不是。这种写法让重排语义清楚；更节省的布局、视图或原地块内重排需要额外证明和测量。"},{"q":"为什么数值检查可用零容差？","a":"转置只搬运 float32 比特，不进行浮点算术；对于有限测试数据应逐值完全相同。"}],"checklist":["Y 的形状为 [N,M] 且连续。","使用 M!=N 的输入验证全局坐标。","验证两个方向都不整除 TILE 的边缘。","输出缓冲区与输入不重叠。"],"blanks":[{"prompt":"输入 tile 起点为 (by*T,bx*T)，输出 tile 起点应为 ____。","answer":"(bx*T, by*T)","hint":"转置交换行列。"},{"prompt":"32×32 的 float32 tile 占 ____ 字节。","answer":"4096","hint":"每个 float32 为 4 字节。"}],"references":[{"label":"TileLang 官方：指令、访存与同步","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/docs/programming_guides/instructions.md"},{"label":"TileLang 官方：共享视角、内存作用域与同步","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/docs/programming_guides/language_basics.md"}]},{"id":"P03","module":"M1","title":"全局 Reduce Sum","subtitle":"把 block 内归约和全局同步分开","difficulty":"进阶","minutes":35,"tags":["Reduction","Two-stage","Neutral element","Synchronization"],"statement":"对一维 float32 输入求和。第一阶段每个 block 产生一个部分和，第二阶段由一个 block 归约所有部分和。完整脚本包括临时缓冲区、两次编译与按依赖顺序调用，避免把 block 内归约误当作整个 GPU 的归约。","formula":"Partial[b] = Σ X[b·BLOCK+i]; Y[0] = Σ Partial[b]","inputs":"X: [N] float32，连续 CUDA 张量。","outputs":"Y: [1] float32；中间 Partial: [ceildiv(N,BLOCK)]。","constraints":["BLOCK=1024，1<=N<=BLOCK²，保证第二阶段能装入单个 tile。","输入只含有限值；空输入需要主机侧单独定义零和，本脚本明确拒绝。","归约使用 float32；并行加法次序与 PyTorch 不同，因此使用容差验证。","两次启动必须按同一执行流的依赖顺序执行；脚本采用默认调用顺序。","教学脚本已做 Python 语法检查；当前环境没有 TileLang / PyTorch，未进行 GPU 编译、正确性运行或性能测量。"],"approach":["构造一个通用的 block_sum 工厂：每个 block 将至多 BLOCK 个元素写入 [1,BLOCK] fragment，尾部写零。","调用 T.reduce_sum(...,dim=1)，输出形状是 [1]，再写到本 block 唯一的部分和位置。","第一阶段处理原数组，第二阶段复用相同工厂处理 Partial；第二阶段的 grid 恰好为 1。","N>BLOCK² 时需要继续递归地归约 partial，直到只剩一个结果。不能让第二阶段只看前 BLOCK 个部分和。","整体还会读写部分和并多一次 kernel 启动，带宽计算不能只看最终输出大小。"],"mapping":[{"cuda":"warp shuffle + shared block sum","tilelang":"T.reduce_sum(tile, scalar, dim=1)","why":"显式声明归约轴，线程内与线程间归约由编译器展开。"},{"cuda":"临时数组 + 第二个 kernel","tilelang":"stage1(X,Partial); stage2(Partial,Y)","why":"不同 block 之间的完成顺序通过启动依赖建立。"},{"cuda":"尾部线程加入 0","tilelang":"无效 tile 元素写 0.0","why":"加法单位元不改变归约值。"}],"versions":[{"name":"V0 · 完整两阶段调用","note":"包含工作区分配与第二次启动，限定最多 1024 个第一阶段 block。教学脚本已做 Python 语法检查；当前环境没有 TileLang / PyTorch，未进行 GPU 编译、正确性运行或性能测量。","code":"# Python 语法已检查；未在 GPU 上验证。\nimport torch\nimport tilelang\nimport tilelang.language as T\n\n\ndef make_block_sum(N, BLOCK=1024):\n    assert N > 0\n    P = (N + BLOCK - 1) // BLOCK\n\n    @T.prim_func\n    def main(\n        X: T.Tensor((N,), \"float32\"),\n        Partial: T.Tensor((P,), \"float32\"),\n    ):\n        with T.Kernel(P, threads=256) as bx:\n            values = T.alloc_fragment((1, BLOCK), \"float32\")\n            total = T.alloc_fragment((1,), \"float32\")\n            for i, j in T.Parallel(1, BLOCK):\n                idx = bx * BLOCK + j\n                if idx < N:\n                    values[i, j] = X[idx]\n                else:\n                    values[i, j] = 0.0\n            T.reduce_sum(values, total, dim=1)\n            for i in T.Parallel(1):\n                Partial[bx] = total[i]\n\n    return tilelang.compile(main, target=\"cuda\")\n\n\ndef prepare_two_stage(N, device, BLOCK=1024):\n    assert 1 <= N <= BLOCK * BLOCK\n    P = (N + BLOCK - 1) // BLOCK\n    partial = torch.empty(P, device=device, dtype=torch.float32)\n    y = torch.empty(1, device=device, dtype=torch.float32)\n    stage1 = make_block_sum(N, BLOCK)\n    stage2 = make_block_sum(P, BLOCK)\n    # 返回已编译 kernel 与已分配工作区，方便放到计时外。\n    return stage1, stage2, partial, y\n\n\ndef main():\n    torch.manual_seed(0)\n    for N in [1, 1025, 1_000_003]:\n        x = torch.randn(N, device=\"cuda\", dtype=torch.float32)\n        stage1, stage2, partial, y = prepare_two_stage(N, x.device)\n        # 同一执行流按顺序启动；第二阶段消费第一阶段结果。\n        stage1(x, partial)\n        stage2(partial, y)\n        ref = x.sum().reshape(1)\n        torch.testing.assert_close(y, ref, rtol=1e-4, atol=1e-2)\n    print(\"Two-stage reduce-sum reference checks passed\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"}],"pitfalls":[{"title":"第二阶段没有覆盖全部 partial","body":"示例为完整两阶段而限制 N<=1024²。超出此范围必须添加递归阶段，不能保持第二阶段单 tile 却忽略剩余元素。"},{"title":"使用 block 屏障做全局同步","body":"块内同步只能协调一个 block。第二次 kernel 启动及流顺序才是此实现的全局依赖边界。"},{"title":"要求 float32 串行同序结果","body":"加法不满足浮点结合律。两阶段树形求和与参考实现可能有舍入差异，绝不能用逐比特相等作为唯一标准。"}],"questions":[{"q":"为什么不用 atomic_add 写一个全局标量？","a":"可以设计原子版本，但每次运行前要清零，竞争和不固定加法顺序也会影响性能与误差；这里用两阶段让依赖与结果所有权更清楚。"},{"q":"如果只剩一个 partial 还需要第二次启动吗？","a":"语义上可以直接返回该 partial；示例统一保留两阶段，实际调度器可以为 P=1 省去启动。"},{"q":"如何扩展到任意正整数 N？","a":"重复编译或缓存 block_sum(当前长度)，每轮把 ceildiv(当前长度,BLOCK) 个结果交给下一轮，直到长度为 1，并保留各轮工作区的生命周期。"}],"checklist":["尾部填 0，不能读取未初始化 fragment。","Partial 长度等于 ceildiv(N,BLOCK)。","第二阶段输入长度是 P，不是原来的 N。","测试 N=1、BLOCK+1 和大规模非整除输入。"],"blanks":[{"prompt":"sum 的无效元素应填 ____。","answer":"0","hint":"寻找加法单位元。"},{"prompt":"BLOCK=1024，N=1,000,003 时第一阶段产生 ____ 个部分和。","answer":"977","hint":"向上整除；976×1024=999424。"}],"references":[{"label":"TileLang 官方源码：reduce_sum / max / min","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/tilelang/language/reduce_op.py"},{"label":"TileLang 官方：指令、访存与同步","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/docs/programming_guides/instructions.md"},{"label":"TileLang 官方源码：compile 与输出参数","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/tilelang/jit/__init__.py"}]},{"id":"P04","module":"M1","title":"按行 Sum / Max 工具箱","subtitle":"相同 tile，不同单位元与输出形状","difficulty":"入门","minutes":25,"tags":["Row reduction","Sum","Max","Mask"],"statement":"给定 X[M,N]，每行分别输出元素和与最大值。一个 block 负责一行，使用两个 fragment 对尾部采用不同的中性填充值。这道题是 Softmax、LayerNorm 和 Argmax 的基础。","formula":"Sum[m] = Σₙ X[m,n]; Max[m] = maxₙ X[m,n]","inputs":"X: [M,N] float32，连续 CUDA 张量。","outputs":"Sum: [M] float32；Max: [M] float32。","constraints":["M>0，1<=N<=4096；BLOCK 取不小于 N 的最小二次幂。","输入值有限，不承诺含 NaN 时的传播规则。","一行由一个 block 处理；超长行需要分段归约与第二阶段。","教学脚本已做 Python 语法检查；当前环境没有 TileLang / PyTorch，未进行 GPU 编译、正确性运行或性能测量。"],"approach":["把一行加载到 [1,BLOCK] fragment；另一个 fragment 持有供 max 使用的副本。","合法位置都读取 X[row,j]；无效位置在 sum fragment 中写 0，在 max fragment 中写 -∞。","T.reduce_sum 与 T.reduce_max 都沿 dim=1，输出均为 [1] fragment，再写到全局的 row 位置。","单 block 每行是清楚的基线。短行时可以尝试一块多行，长行时考虑分段，是否有收益由资源占用和吞吐决定。"],"mapping":[{"cuda":"每个 block 处理一行","tilelang":"T.Kernel(M) as row","why":"归约范围与 block 的工作范围一致，输出拥有唯一写入者。"},{"cuda":"sum identity=0, max identity=-∞","tilelang":"分别构造 xs 与 xm 的尾部","why":"同一补零策略不能同时服务两种归约。"},{"cuda":"warp / block reduce toolkit","tilelang":"T.reduce_sum / T.reduce_max","why":"同一个归约接口使用不同运算与单位元。"}],"versions":[{"name":"V0 · 双归约基线","note":"用独立的单位元处理非整除 N，并加入全负数测试。教学脚本已做 Python 语法检查；当前环境没有 TileLang / PyTorch，未进行 GPU 编译、正确性运行或性能测量。","code":"# Python 语法已检查；未在 GPU 上验证。\nimport torch\nimport tilelang\nimport tilelang.language as T\n\n\ndef make_row_stats(M, N):\n    assert M > 0 and 1 <= N <= 4096\n    BLOCK = 1 << (N - 1).bit_length()\n\n    @T.prim_func\n    def main(\n        X: T.Tensor((M, N), \"float32\"),\n        Sum: T.Tensor((M,), \"float32\"),\n        Max: T.Tensor((M,), \"float32\"),\n    ):\n        with T.Kernel(M, threads=256) as row:\n            xs = T.alloc_fragment((1, BLOCK), \"float32\")\n            xm = T.alloc_fragment((1, BLOCK), \"float32\")\n            s = T.alloc_fragment((1,), \"float32\")\n            m = T.alloc_fragment((1,), \"float32\")\n            for i, j in T.Parallel(1, BLOCK):\n                if j < N:\n                    xs[i, j] = X[row, j]\n                    xm[i, j] = X[row, j]\n                else:\n                    xs[i, j] = 0.0\n                    xm[i, j] = -T.infinity(\"float32\")\n            T.reduce_sum(xs, s, dim=1)\n            T.reduce_max(xm, m, dim=1)\n            for i in T.Parallel(1):\n                Sum[row] = s[i]\n                Max[row] = m[i]\n\n    return tilelang.compile(main, target=\"cuda\")\n\n\ndef main():\n    torch.manual_seed(0)\n    for M, N in [(257, 1001), (17, 4096), (5, 1)]:\n        x = torch.randn(M, N, device=\"cuda\", dtype=torch.float32)\n        # 确保错误地以 0 填充 max 时会被发现。\n        x[0] = -x[0].abs() - 1.0\n        sums = torch.empty(M, device=\"cuda\", dtype=torch.float32)\n        maxima = torch.empty_like(sums)\n        kernel = make_row_stats(M, N)\n        kernel(x, sums, maxima)\n        torch.testing.assert_close(sums, x.sum(dim=1), rtol=1e-4, atol=1e-3)\n        torch.testing.assert_close(maxima, x.amax(dim=1), rtol=0, atol=0)\n    print(\"Row sum/max reference checks passed\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"}],"pitfalls":[{"title":"Max 尾部填零","body":"当整行都是负数，零会错误地成为最大值。这里的 max padding 必须为 -∞。"},{"title":"归约轴写反","body":"输入 fragment 为 [1,BLOCK]，要归约的是 dim=1，结果形状为 [1]。沿 dim=0 会留下整条列向量。"},{"title":"无限扩大单行 tile","body":"把 BLOCK 从 4096 扩到几十万会增大寄存器压力，甚至编译失败。长度限制是本实现的契约。"}],"questions":[{"q":"为什么结果使用形状 [1] 而非 Python 标量？","a":"归约结果仍是 DSL 中的缓冲区，且可以按 tile 数据流接到后续计算；[1] 也明确表达去掉最后一维后的形状。"},{"q":"sum 与 max 能共用同一个输入 fragment 吗？","a":"整除时可共用；有尾部时要在两次归约之间替换无效位置的单位元，或像本例保留两个版本。"},{"q":"很短的 N 为什么可能浪费线程？","a":"每行固定 256 个线程，但有效元素可能很少；一块处理多行有机会增加有效工作，仍需用合适的布局和基准验证。"}],"checklist":["全负输入的 max 保持为负。","N 非二次幂时两种 padding 分别正确。","正确使用 dim=1 与 [1] 输出。","sum 使用容差；有限输入的 max 可精确比较。"],"blanks":[{"prompt":"max 的尾部单位元为 ____。","answer":"-∞","hint":"它不应大于任何合法有限输入。"},{"prompt":"[1,BLOCK] 沿 dim=1 归约，输出形状为 ____。","answer":"[1]","hint":"被归约维被移除。"}],"references":[{"label":"TileLang 官方源码：reduce_sum / max / min","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/tilelang/language/reduce_op.py"},{"label":"TileLang 官方：指令、访存与同步","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/docs/programming_guides/instructions.md"}]},{"id":"P05","module":"M1","title":"Max / Argmax","subtitle":"把重复最大值的第一位置写进契约","difficulty":"进阶","minutes":30,"tags":["Argmax","Tie break","Reduction","Index"],"statement":"对 X[M,N] 的每一行返回最大值及其第一次出现的列号。把语义拆成两次归约：先求最大值，再对等于最大值的合法列号求最小值。该基线优先展示明确的 tie-break，不使用未核实的 argmax 专用接口。","formula":"V[m] = maxₙ X[m,n]; I[m] = min{n | X[m,n]=V[m]}","inputs":"X: [M,N] float32，连续 CUDA 张量。","outputs":"V: [M] float32；I: [M] int32，重复最大值返回最小列号。","constraints":["M>0，1<=N<=4096；输入必须为有限 float32 值。","列号用 int32，N 不得超出其可表示范围；本教学约束远低于该上限。","不定义 NaN 的排序、传播和 tie-break；加入 NaN 支持必须先补充完整语义。","每行由一个 block 处理；这里没有实现跨 block 的值-索引二元归约。","教学脚本已做 Python 语法检查；当前环境没有 TileLang / PyTorch，未进行 GPU 编译、正确性运行或性能测量。"],"approach":["把行补到二次幂 BLOCK，无效值用 -∞ 填充，先用 T.reduce_max 得到行最大值。","构造 int32 候选列号：合法且值等于最大值的位置写 j，其余写 2147483647。","T.reduce_min 对候选列号做归约，得到第一个最大值的位置。这是确定的 tie-break，而非依赖线程执行先后。","长行的跨块版本必须合并 (value,index) 对：优先较大 value，value 相等时选较小 index。仅对每块 index 求 min 会出错。"],"mapping":[{"cuda":"比较 value,index 的二元归约","tilelang":"reduce_max 后 reduce_min(candidate)","why":"把二元比较的语义拆成两个内置归约，接口简单、可验证。"},{"cuda":"平值时选较小 idx","tilelang":"合法最大值写列号，其余写 INT_MAX","why":"最小值归约保证选择第一次出现的位置。"},{"cuda":"invalid lane","tilelang":"值填 -∞，索引候选填 INT_MAX","why":"值域和索引域各自需要不会胜出的占位值。"}],"versions":[{"name":"V0 · 两遍块内归约","note":"两次归约都在同一 kernel 内，整行只需从全局内存加载到 fragment。教学脚本已做 Python 语法检查；当前环境没有 TileLang / PyTorch，未进行 GPU 编译、正确性运行或性能测量。","code":"# Python 语法已检查；未在 GPU 上验证。\nimport torch\nimport tilelang\nimport tilelang.language as T\n\n\ndef make_row_argmax(M, N):\n    assert M > 0 and 1 <= N <= 4096\n    BLOCK = 1 << (N - 1).bit_length()\n\n    @T.prim_func\n    def main(\n        X: T.Tensor((M, N), \"float32\"),\n        V: T.Tensor((M,), \"float32\"),\n        I: T.Tensor((M,), \"int32\"),\n    ):\n        with T.Kernel(M, threads=256) as row:\n            x = T.alloc_fragment((1, BLOCK), \"float32\")\n            vmax = T.alloc_fragment((1,), \"float32\")\n            candidate = T.alloc_fragment((1, BLOCK), \"int32\")\n            first = T.alloc_fragment((1,), \"int32\")\n            for i, j in T.Parallel(1, BLOCK):\n                if j < N:\n                    x[i, j] = X[row, j]\n                else:\n                    x[i, j] = -T.infinity(\"float32\")\n            T.reduce_max(x, vmax, dim=1)\n            for i, j in T.Parallel(1, BLOCK):\n                candidate[i, j] = T.if_then_else(\n                    (j < N) & (x[i, j] == vmax[i]),\n                    j, 2147483647,\n                )\n            T.reduce_min(candidate, first, dim=1)\n            for i in T.Parallel(1):\n                V[row] = vmax[i]\n                I[row] = first[i]\n\n    return tilelang.compile(main, target=\"cuda\")\n\n\ndef main():\n    torch.manual_seed(0)\n    M, N = 257, 1001\n    x = torch.randn(M, N, device=\"cuda\", dtype=torch.float32)\n    x[0] = -1.0\n    x[0, 5] = 10.0\n    x[0, 17] = 10.0  # 平值必须选择列 5。\n    x[1] = -3.0      # 整行平值必须选择列 0。\n    v = torch.empty(M, device=\"cuda\", dtype=torch.float32)\n    idx = torch.empty(M, device=\"cuda\", dtype=torch.int32)\n    kernel = make_row_argmax(M, N)\n    kernel(x, v, idx)\n    ref_v, ref_i = x.max(dim=1)\n    torch.testing.assert_close(v, ref_v, rtol=0, atol=0)\n    torch.testing.assert_close(idx, ref_i.to(torch.int32), rtol=0, atol=0)\n    print(\"Max / first-argmax reference checks passed\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"}],"pitfalls":[{"title":"只求到最大值，位置靠猜","body":"最大值不携带其位置。相等判断后的候选索引归约是算法的一部分，不能省略。"},{"title":"用 0 作为无效索引","body":"reduce_min 会把 0 当成最优候选。无效候选必须设为比任何合法列号都大的值。"},{"title":"NaN 语义不明确","body":"NaN 与自身比较也不相等，本例的第二次归约将失去合法候选。输入契约明确排除 NaN；不能宣称支持所有 float32 比特模式。"}],"questions":[{"q":"为什么第二次归约使用 min？","a":"所有合法候选都已经具有同样的最大值，剩下的问题就是选择最小列号。"},{"q":"一个 block 同时发现多个最大值会竞争写 I 吗？","a":"不会。候选先进入归约，最终只有归约结果位置的写回，不让多个线程分别写全局索引。"},{"q":"跨块时如何保证第一位置？","a":"部分结果带全局列号。合并时先比较值，值相等时比较列号，并把这个比较规则用于所有层级。"}],"checklist":["覆盖两个位置共享最大值的行。","覆盖整行平值，结果应为 0。","非整除 N 的无效列永远不能胜出。","确认 int32 输出与 PyTorch int64 参考显式转换。"],"blanks":[{"prompt":"非候选索引应填 ____，再执行 reduce_min。","answer":"INT_MAX / 2147483647","hint":"无效值不能小于合法列号。"},{"prompt":"候选条件是 j<N 且 ____。","answer":"x[i,j] == vmax[i]","hint":"只有最大值所在位置参与索引竞选。"}],"references":[{"label":"TileLang 官方源码：reduce_sum / max / min","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/tilelang/language/reduce_op.py"},{"label":"TileLang 官方：指令、访存与同步","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/docs/programming_guides/instructions.md"}]},{"id":"P06","module":"M2","title":"Prefix Scan","subtitle":"理解 inclusive、exclusive 与跨块前缀","difficulty":"进阶","minutes":40,"tags":["Scan","Cumsum","Prefix","Shared memory"],"statement":"对矩阵的每一行执行前缀和，分别实现 inclusive 与 exclusive 两种语义。教学实现把整行放进一个 block 的共享 tile，用 T.cumsum 得到 inclusive 结果，再按定义生成 exclusive 输出。此版本明确限制一行最多 1024 个元素。","formula":"Inclusive[m,j] = Σₖ₌₀ʲ X[m,k]; Exclusive[m,0]=0, Exclusive[m,j]=Σₖ₌₀ʲ⁻¹ X[m,k]","inputs":"X: [M,N] float32，连续 CUDA 张量。","outputs":"Y: [M,N] float32；factory 参数 exclusive 控制语义。","constraints":["M>0，1<=N<=1024；BLOCK 取不小于 N 的最小二次幂。","每行由一个 block 处理，脚本不实现跨 block 的全长 scan。","输入为有限值，float32 并行加法的舍入次序可能不同于 torch.cumsum。","inclusive 与 exclusive 是两个编译期变体；不要把 exclusive 错写成 reverse scan。","教学脚本已做 Python 语法检查；当前环境没有 TileLang / PyTorch，未进行 GPU 编译、正确性运行或性能测量。"],"approach":["加载一行到共享 tile，尾部补 0。T.cumsum(src=tile,dst=tile,dim=0) 就地写出 inclusive 前缀。","inclusive 直接写回；exclusive 的第 0 个结果为 0，其余结果读取 inclusive[j-1]。这样无需用减法从 inclusive 中扣除当前值。","共享内存让块内不同线程交换前缀状态，默认编译流程处理相关同步。T.cumsum 是 scan 原语，不是普通 sum 归约。","跨 block 的完整路线有三步：块内 scan 并保存块总和；对块总和做 exclusive scan；把对应块之前的总和加到每个块的局部输出。块总和太长时，这个过程继续递归。","不同 block 之间不能靠 T.tvm_storage_sync('shared') 协调。本脚本只展示单行单块，三阶段路线是扩展设计而不是已实现版本。"],"mapping":[{"cuda":"Hillis–Steele / Blelloch 块内 scan","tilelang":"T.cumsum(shared,shared,dim=0)","why":"声明前缀依赖，具体扫描分解交给原语的后端实现。"},{"cuda":"exclusive 前缀移位","tilelang":"j==0 ? 0 : inclusive[j-1]","why":"精确对应输出定义，并避免额外减法造成消去误差。"},{"cuda":"block totals + uniform add","tilelang":"额外 totals scan 与 add kernels","why":"T.cumsum 的单个 block 不能自动传播其他 block 的前缀。"}],"versions":[{"name":"V0 · 单行单块，双语义","note":"包含 inclusive 和 exclusive 的完整编译调用与 PyTorch 参考。跨块三阶段仅在思路中说明。教学脚本已做 Python 语法检查；当前环境没有 TileLang / PyTorch，未进行 GPU 编译、正确性运行或性能测量。","code":"# Python 语法已检查；未在 GPU 上验证。\nimport torch\nimport tilelang\nimport tilelang.language as T\n\n\ndef make_row_scan(M, N, exclusive=False):\n    assert M > 0 and 1 <= N <= 1024\n    BLOCK = 1 << (N - 1).bit_length()\n\n    @T.prim_func\n    def main(\n        X: T.Tensor((M, N), \"float32\"),\n        Y: T.Tensor((M, N), \"float32\"),\n    ):\n        with T.Kernel(M, threads=256) as row:\n            values = T.alloc_shared((BLOCK,), \"float32\")\n            for j in T.Parallel(BLOCK):\n                if j < N:\n                    values[j] = X[row, j]\n                else:\n                    values[j] = 0.0\n            T.cumsum(src=values, dst=values, dim=0)\n            for j in T.Parallel(BLOCK):\n                if j < N:\n                    if exclusive:\n                        if j == 0:\n                            Y[row, j] = 0.0\n                        else:\n                            Y[row, j] = values[j - 1]\n                    else:\n                        Y[row, j] = values[j]\n\n    return tilelang.compile(main, target=\"cuda\")\n\n\ndef main():\n    torch.manual_seed(0)\n    for M, N in [(17, 1), (37, 257), (64, 1024)]:\n        x = torch.randn(M, N, device=\"cuda\", dtype=torch.float32)\n        inclusive = torch.cumsum(x, dim=1)\n        for exclusive in [False, True]:\n            y = torch.empty_like(x)\n            kernel = make_row_scan(M, N, exclusive)\n            kernel(x, y)\n            if exclusive:\n                ref = torch.cat(\n                    [torch.zeros_like(x[:, :1]), inclusive[:, :-1]], dim=1\n                )\n            else:\n                ref = inclusive\n            torch.testing.assert_close(y, ref, rtol=1e-4, atol=1e-3)\n    print(\"Inclusive / exclusive row-scan reference checks passed\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"}],"pitfalls":[{"title":"把 inclusive 当成 exclusive","body":"输入 [2,3,5] 的 inclusive 是 [2,5,10]，exclusive 是 [0,2,5]。用很短的手算输入就能暴露偏移错误。"},{"title":"每个块单独 scan 就结束","body":"这只能得到块内前缀。第二块开始前还必须加上前面所有块的总和，否则结果会在块边界重新归零。"},{"title":"独立线程写全局前缀计数器","body":"原子加保证某种累加顺序，但这个顺序不等于输入下标顺序，不能直接替代稳定的前缀和。"}],"questions":[{"q":"为什么补零不会影响有效输出？","a":"scan 的第 j 个结果只依赖不超过 j 的位置。尾部填充值排在所有有效输入之后，且零是加法单位元。"},{"q":"跨块的 offsets 应用 inclusive 还是 exclusive？","a":"应对块总和做 exclusive scan，让 block b 获得所有编号小于 b 的块的总和。"},{"q":"为什么不通过 inclusive[j]-X[j] 生成 exclusive？","a":"代数上等价，但减法可能放大消去误差；读取前一个 inclusive 结果更直接地满足定义。"},{"q":"T.cumsum 放在 fragment 上是否永远只用寄存器？","a":"不能这样假设。官方当前实现会对 fragment scan 暂存到共享内存；本例直接使用 shared，让资源含义清楚。"}],"checklist":["[2,3,5] 手算检查两种语义。","N=1 时 exclusive 输出必须全为 0。","验证 N=257 等非整除形状。","超过 1024 列时明确拒绝，扩展时补齐 totals scan 和 uniform add。"],"blanks":[{"prompt":"[2,3,5] 的 exclusive scan 是 ____。","answer":"[0,2,5]","hint":"当前元素不参与当前前缀。"},{"prompt":"给 block b 的补偿量应等于编号 ____ b 的所有块总和。","answer":"小于","hint":"当前块已经完成自身的局部 scan。"}],"references":[{"label":"TileLang 官方源码：cumsum","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/tilelang/language/scan_op.py"},{"label":"TileLang 官方：指令、访存与同步","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/docs/programming_guides/instructions.md"}]},{"id":"P07","module":"M3","title":"Stable Row Softmax","subtitle":"先减最大值，再做两次行归约","difficulty":"进阶","minutes":35,"tags":["行归约","数值稳定","尾部掩码"],"statement":"给定连续的 FP32 矩阵 X[M,N]，对每行独立计算 Softmax。一个 block 持有一整行，完成最大值归约、指数、求和和归一化。代码覆盖非 2 次幂 N；重点是归约轴、padding 中性值和浮点数边界。","formula":"m_i=max_j x_ij；p_ij=exp(x_ij−m_i)/Σ_k exp(x_ik−m_i)","inputs":"X: [M,N]，连续 float32 CUDA 张量；M>0，1≤N≤4096。","outputs":"Y: [M,N], float32；每行非负且和约等于 1。","constraints":["仅支持有限输入；NaN、+Inf、整行 −Inf 不在本题契约内。","BLOCK 为不小于 N 的 2 次幂；一个 block 处理一行。","长行需要分段归约或 online softmax，不能无限增加寄存器 tile。","已核对官方 API 并通过 Python 语法检查；本环境未安装 TileLang/PyTorch，未进行 GPU 编译、正确性运行或性能实测。"],"approach":["将列长度补到 2 次幂，padding 设为 −Inf，不影响 max 且指数后为 0。","归约行最大值，再对每个元素计算 exp(x−max)。","归约分母，只写回真实列；中间指数值留在 fragment。"],"mapping":[{"cuda":"warp/block reduce max","tilelang":"T.reduce_max(..., dim=1)","why":"表达列归约，由编译器生成线程通信。"},{"cuda":"指数后的 block reduce sum","tilelang":"T.Parallel + T.reduce_sum","why":"数据留在 fragment，避免临时矩阵落到全局内存。"},{"cuda":"越界 lane 加载 −Inf","tilelang":"T.if_then_else(j < N, ..., −T.infinity(...))","why":"保持归约语义且不读取无效列。"}],"versions":[{"name":"v0 · 单行寄存器融合","note":"完整脚本，含 N=1、尾部和大有限偏置；128 线程只是起点。已核对官方 API 并通过 Python 语法检查；本环境未安装 TileLang/PyTorch，未进行 GPU 编译、正确性运行或性能实测。","code":"# Status: syntax checked only; not compiled or run on a GPU here.\nimport torch\nimport tilelang\nimport tilelang.language as T\n\n\n@tilelang.jit(target=\"cuda\")\ndef make_softmax(M, N):\n    assert M > 0 and 1 <= N <= 4096\n    BLOCK = 1 << (N - 1).bit_length()\n\n    @T.prim_func\n    def main(X: T.Tensor((M, N), \"float32\"),\n             Y: T.Tensor((M, N), \"float32\")):\n        with T.Kernel(M, threads=128) as row:\n            values = T.alloc_fragment((1, BLOCK), \"float32\")\n            maximum = T.alloc_fragment((1,), \"float32\")\n            denominator = T.alloc_fragment((1,), \"float32\")\n            for j in T.Parallel(BLOCK):\n                values[0, j] = T.if_then_else(\n                    j < N, X[row, j], -T.infinity(\"float32\"))\n            T.reduce_max(values, maximum, dim=1)\n            for j in T.Parallel(BLOCK):\n                values[0, j] = T.exp(values[0, j] - maximum[0])\n            T.reduce_sum(values, denominator, dim=1)\n            for j in T.Parallel(BLOCK):\n                if j < N:\n                    Y[row, j] = values[0, j] / denominator[0]\n    return main\n\n\ndef check(M, N):\n    assert torch.cuda.is_available()\n    x = (torch.randn((M, N), device=\"cuda\") * 10).contiguous()\n    x[0].fill_(1000.0)\n    if M > 1:\n        x[1].add_(1000.0)\n    y = torch.empty_like(x)\n    make_softmax(M, N)(x, y)\n    torch.testing.assert_close(y, torch.softmax(x, -1),\n                               rtol=1e-4, atol=1e-6)\n    torch.testing.assert_close(y.sum(-1), torch.ones(M, device=\"cuda\"),\n                               rtol=1e-5, atol=1e-5)\n    print(f\"passed: M={M}, N={N}\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    torch.manual_seed(0)\n    for n in (1, 127, 1024, 4095):\n        check(32, n)\n"}],"pitfalls":[{"title":"padding 不应填 0","body":"真实元素全为负时，0 会抬高 max，且越界元素指数后会错误进入分母。应填 −Inf。"},{"title":"特殊值需定义契约","body":"减最大值避免有限输入的大正指数；整行 −Inf 仍会出现 −Inf−(−Inf)。带 mask 的生产实现需定义全掩码行行为。"},{"title":"长行寄存器压力","body":"N 很大可能溢出到 local memory。应检查编译资源与实际流量，再决定分段。"}],"questions":[{"q":"为什么减最大值不改变结果？","a":"分子分母同时乘 exp(−m)，比值不变；至少一个有效元素变成 exp(0)=1。"},{"q":"为什么不用原子加？","a":"一个 block 拥有完整行，归约在块内完成，没有跨 block 合并。"},{"q":"N 增到 65536 怎样改？","a":"考虑分块求局部 max/sum 后合并，或 online softmax，重新权衡寄存器与额外读写。"}],"checklist":["验证 N=1、127、4095。","与 torch.softmax 对比并检查行和。","构造常数行与大有限偏置。"],"blanks":[{"prompt":"Softmax padding 的加载值应为 ______。","answer":"-T.infinity(\"float32\")","hint":"不影响 max，且指数后贡献 0。"},{"prompt":"values 形状为 [1,BLOCK]，沿列归约的 dim 是 ______。","answer":"1","hint":"dim=0 会归约长度为 1 的行轴。"}],"references":[{"label":"TileLang 官方核心指令","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/docs/programming_guides/instructions.md"},{"label":"TileLang 官方归约源码","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/tilelang/language/reduce_op.py"}]},{"id":"P08","module":"M3","title":"LayerNorm","subtitle":"用中心方差避开 E[x²]−E[x]² 的消减","difficulty":"进阶","minutes":45,"tags":["归一化","两遍归约","FP32"],"statement":"给定 X[M,N]、gamma[N]、beta[N]，实现最后一维 LayerNorm。先计算均值，再归约中心平方差；统计量使用 FP32，融合 affine。“两遍”指寄存器中的两次统计遍历，不要求从显存重复读取 X。","formula":"μ_i=Σ_jx_ij/N；σ²_i=Σ_j(x_ij−μ_i)²/N；y_ij=(x_ij−μ_i)·rsqrt(σ²_i+ε)·γ_j+β_j","inputs":"X: [M,N]；gamma、beta: [N]；连续 float32 CUDA 张量；epsilon>0。","outputs":"Y: [M,N], float32；使用总体方差，分母是 N。","constraints":["M>0，1≤N≤4096；输入与权重有限、幅度适中，FP32 均值归约和中心平方差归约都不得溢出。","仅前向、最后一维归一化；不支持 backward、任意 strides、多轴归一化。","中心平方差改善稳定性，FP32 求和仍有舍入误差。","已核对官方 API 并通过 Python 语法检查；本环境未安装 TileLang/PyTorch，未进行 GPU 编译、正确性运行或性能实测。"],"approach":["加载完整行，padding 填 0；归约 sum 除以真实 N。","保留原始值，按均值计算中心平方差；padding 平方差显式设为 0。","归约平方差，求 rsqrt(var+eps)，融合 gamma/beta 输出。"],"mapping":[{"cuda":"两次 warp/block sum","tilelang":"两次 T.reduce_sum(..., dim=1)","why":"直接表达均值和中心方差。"},{"cuda":"寄存器复用输入","tilelang":"T.alloc_fragment((1,BLOCK), \"float32\")","why":"统计与 affine 共用已加载数据。"},{"cuda":"sqrt 再求倒数","tilelang":"T.rsqrt(variance/N+EPS)","why":"epsilon 在平方根内部。"}],"versions":[{"name":"v0 · 均值 + 中心方差","note":"完整 FP32 脚本，覆盖常数行和带偏置输入；没有把两遍法称为 Welford。已核对官方 API 并通过 Python 语法检查；本环境未安装 TileLang/PyTorch，未进行 GPU 编译、正确性运行或性能实测。","code":"# Status: syntax checked only; not compiled or run on a GPU here.\nimport torch\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\nimport tilelang\nimport tilelang.language as T\n\n\n@tilelang.jit(target=\"cuda\")\ndef make_layernorm(M, N, EPS=1e-5):\n    assert M > 0 and 1 <= N <= 4096 and EPS > 0\n    BLOCK = 1 << (N - 1).bit_length()\n\n    @T.prim_func\n    def main(X: T.Tensor((M, N), \"float32\"),\n             G: T.Tensor((N,), \"float32\"),\n             B: T.Tensor((N,), \"float32\"),\n             Y: T.Tensor((M, N), \"float32\")):\n        with T.Kernel(M, threads=128) as row:\n            values = T.alloc_fragment((1, BLOCK), \"float32\")\n            centered_sq = T.alloc_fragment((1, BLOCK), \"float32\")\n            total = T.alloc_fragment((1,), \"float32\")\n            mean = T.alloc_fragment((1,), \"float32\")\n            variance = T.alloc_fragment((1,), \"float32\")\n            invstd = T.alloc_fragment((1,), \"float32\")\n            for j in T.Parallel(BLOCK):\n                values[0, j] = T.if_then_else(j < N, X[row, j], 0.0)\n            T.reduce_sum(values, total, dim=1)\n            for r in T.Parallel(1):\n                mean[r] = total[r] / N\n            # Second statistical pass: centered squared differences.\n            for j in T.Parallel(BLOCK):\n                centered_sq[0, j] = T.if_then_else(\n                    j < N, (values[0, j] - mean[0]) * (values[0, j] - mean[0]), 0.0)\n            T.reduce_sum(centered_sq, variance, dim=1)\n            for r in T.Parallel(1):\n                invstd[r] = T.rsqrt(variance[r] / N + EPS)\n            for j in T.Parallel(BLOCK):\n                if j < N:\n                    Y[row, j] = ((values[0, j] - mean[0])\n                                 * invstd[0] * G[j] + B[j])\n    return main\n\n\ndef check(N, offset):\n    M, eps = 32, 1e-5\n    x = (torch.randn((M, N), device=\"cuda\") + offset).contiguous()\n    x[0].fill_(offset)\n    gamma = torch.randn(N, device=\"cuda\")\n    beta = torch.randn(N, device=\"cuda\")\n    y = torch.empty_like(x)\n    make_layernorm(M, N, eps)(x, gamma, beta, y)\n    ref = F.layer_norm(x, (N,), gamma, beta, eps)\n    torch.testing.assert_close(y, ref, rtol=3e-4, atol=3e-4)\n    print(f\"passed: N={N}, offset={offset}\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    assert torch.cuda.is_available()\n    torch.manual_seed(0)\n    for n in (1, 255, 1024, 4095):\n        check(n, 0.0)\n        check(n, 100.0)\n"}],"pitfalls":[{"title":"padding 的平方差也要清零","body":"原始 padding=0，减均值后一般不为 0，不能让这些虚构位置参与方差。"},{"title":"分母使用真实 N","body":"不能使用 BLOCK 或 N−1；LayerNorm 的参考语义是总体方差。"},{"title":"大均值、小方差","body":"E[x²]−E[x]² 可能严重消减甚至变负。中心平方差能改善，极端场景还应考虑 Welford 与更高精度参考。"}],"questions":[{"q":"这是 Welford 吗？","a":"不是。它先求均值再算中心平方差；Welford 维护可合并的 count、mean、M2。"},{"q":"为什么不是除以 N−1？","a":"LayerNorm 使用这一组特征的总体方差，与 torch.layer_norm 对齐应除以 N。"},{"q":"gamma=1、beta=0 后方差一定是 1？","a":"epsilon 使结果方差约为 var/(var+eps)；常数行输出为 0。"}],"checklist":["测试 N=1、常数行、非 2 次幂 N。","对齐 F.layer_norm 的 epsilon 和 affine 顺序。","用大均值小波动输入检查误差与 NaN。"],"blanks":[{"prompt":"padding 位置的中心平方差应为 ______。","answer":"0.0","hint":"虚构特征不能贡献方差。"},{"prompt":"LayerNorm 方差的归一化分母是 ______。","answer":"N","hint":"使用总体方差。"}],"references":[{"label":"TileLang 官方核心指令","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/docs/programming_guides/instructions.md"},{"label":"TileLang 官方归约源码","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/tilelang/language/reduce_op.py"},{"label":"PyTorch 官方 LayerNorm 定义","url":"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/stable/generated/torch.nn.LayerNorm.html"}]},{"id":"P09","module":"M3","title":"RMSNorm + Residual","subtitle":"一次平方和归约，融合残差相加","difficulty":"进阶","minutes":35,"tags":["RMSNorm","融合","Residual"],"statement":"实现按行 RMSNorm。基础版直接归一化 X；扩展版先形成 U=X+Residual，再归一化 U。统计与权重乘法在一个 kernel 完成。扩展版只返回 Y，不额外输出 U，也不修改输入残差。","formula":"u=x 或 x+r；rms_inv=rsqrt(Σ_j u_j²/N+ε)；y_j=u_j·rms_inv·w_j","inputs":"X: [M,N]，W: [N]；扩展版另输入 Residual: [M,N]；连续 float32 CUDA 张量。","outputs":"Y: [M,N], float32；不减均值，没有 beta。","constraints":["M>0，1≤N≤4096，epsilon>0；输入/权重有限，U=X 或 X+R 必须有限，且 U 的 FP32 平方和不得溢出。","仅 FP32 前向；不含 FP16/BF16 转换、backward 或 residual 输出。","需要 residual 时选 v1；无 residual 时选 v0，避免多余读取。","已核对官方 API 并通过 Python 语法检查；本环境未安装 TileLang/PyTorch，未进行 GPU 编译、正确性运行或性能实测。"],"approach":["一行一个 block，padding 填 0，计算各列平方。","归约平方和，除以真实 N 后加 epsilon，再取 rsqrt。","输出 values×inv_rms×weight；v1 将 values 替换为 X+Residual 并在寄存器复用。"],"mapping":[{"cuda":"平方和 block reduction","tilelang":"T.reduce_sum(squares, square_sum, dim=1)","why":"只需一类统计量。"},{"cuda":"先 add kernel，再 norm kernel","tilelang":"T.Parallel 直接读取 X+R","why":"无需完整中间 U 的写回与重读。"},{"cuda":"weight[col] 广播","tilelang":"输出乘 W[j]","why":"权重按列、沿行广播。"}],"versions":[{"name":"v0 · 纯 RMSNorm","note":"完整脚本，含全零行。已核对官方 API 并通过 Python 语法检查；本环境未安装 TileLang/PyTorch，未进行 GPU 编译、正确性运行或性能实测。","code":"# Status: syntax checked only; not compiled or run on a GPU here.\nimport torch\nimport tilelang\nimport tilelang.language as T\n\n\n@tilelang.jit(target=\"cuda\")\ndef make_rmsnorm(M, N, EPS=1e-6):\n    assert M > 0 and 1 <= N <= 4096 and EPS > 0\n    BLOCK = 1 << (N - 1).bit_length()\n\n    @T.prim_func\n    def main(X: T.Tensor((M, N), \"float32\"),\n             W: T.Tensor((N,), \"float32\"),\n             Y: T.Tensor((M, N), \"float32\")):\n        with T.Kernel(M, threads=128) as row:\n            values = T.alloc_fragment((1, BLOCK), \"float32\")\n            squares = T.alloc_fragment((1, BLOCK), \"float32\")\n            square_sum = T.alloc_fragment((1,), \"float32\")\n            inv_rms = T.alloc_fragment((1,), \"float32\")\n            for j in T.Parallel(BLOCK):\n                values[0, j] = T.if_then_else(j < N, X[row, j], 0.0)\n                squares[0, j] = values[0, j] * values[0, j]\n            T.reduce_sum(squares, square_sum, dim=1)\n            for r in T.Parallel(1):\n                inv_rms[r] = T.rsqrt(square_sum[r] / N + EPS)\n            for j in T.Parallel(BLOCK):\n                if j < N:\n                    Y[row, j] = values[0, j] * inv_rms[0] * W[j]\n    return main\n\n\ndef reference(x, weight, eps):\n    scale = torch.rsqrt(x.square().mean(-1, keepdim=True) + eps)\n    return x * scale * weight\n\n\ndef check(N):\n    M, eps = 32, 1e-6\n    x = torch.randn((M, N), device=\"cuda\")\n    x[0].zero_()\n    weight = torch.randn(N, device=\"cuda\")\n    y = torch.empty_like(x)\n    make_rmsnorm(M, N, eps)(x, weight, y)\n    torch.testing.assert_close(y, reference(x, weight, eps),\n                               rtol=1e-4, atol=1e-5)\n    print(f\"passed: N={N}\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    assert torch.cuda.is_available()\n    torch.manual_seed(0)\n    for n in (1, 255, 1024, 4095):\n        check(n)\n"},{"name":"v1 · 融合 Residual Add","note":"完整脚本；语义是 RMSNorm(X+R)，只写 Y；未声称实测提速。已核对官方 API 并通过 Python 语法检查；本环境未安装 TileLang/PyTorch，未进行 GPU 编译、正确性运行或性能实测。","code":"# Status: syntax checked only; not compiled or run on a GPU here.\nimport torch\nimport tilelang\nimport tilelang.language as T\n\n\n@tilelang.jit(target=\"cuda\")\ndef make_residual_rmsnorm(M, N, EPS=1e-6):\n    assert M > 0 and 1 <= N <= 4096 and EPS > 0\n    BLOCK = 1 << (N - 1).bit_length()\n\n    @T.prim_func\n    def main(X: T.Tensor((M, N), \"float32\"),\n             R: T.Tensor((M, N), \"float32\"),\n             W: T.Tensor((N,), \"float32\"),\n             Y: T.Tensor((M, N), \"float32\")):\n        with T.Kernel(M, threads=128) as row:\n            combined = T.alloc_fragment((1, BLOCK), \"float32\")\n            squares = T.alloc_fragment((1, BLOCK), \"float32\")\n            square_sum = T.alloc_fragment((1,), \"float32\")\n            inv_rms = T.alloc_fragment((1,), \"float32\")\n            for j in T.Parallel(BLOCK):\n                combined[0, j] = T.if_then_else(\n                    j < N, X[row, j] + R[row, j], 0.0)\n                squares[0, j] = combined[0, j] * combined[0, j]\n            T.reduce_sum(squares, square_sum, dim=1)\n            for r in T.Parallel(1):\n                inv_rms[r] = T.rsqrt(square_sum[r] / N + EPS)\n            for j in T.Parallel(BLOCK):\n                if j < N:\n                    Y[row, j] = combined[0, j] * inv_rms[0] * W[j]\n    return main\n\n\ndef check(M=32, N=1023):\n    eps = 1e-6\n    x = torch.randn((M, N), device=\"cuda\")\n    residual = torch.randn_like(x)\n    weight = torch.randn(N, device=\"cuda\")\n    y = torch.empty_like(x)\n    make_residual_rmsnorm(M, N, eps)(x, residual, weight, y)\n    u = x + residual\n    ref = u * torch.rsqrt(u.square().mean(-1, keepdim=True) + eps)\n    ref = ref * weight\n    torch.testing.assert_close(y, ref, rtol=1e-4, atol=1e-5)\n    print(\"residual RMSNorm passed\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    assert torch.cuda.is_available()\n    torch.manual_seed(0)\n    check()\n"}],"pitfalls":[{"title":"残差放在哪","body":"RMSNorm(X+R) 与 RMSNorm(X)+R 不同；先确认计算图与是否需要保存更新后的残差。"},{"title":"epsilon 位置","body":"epsilon 加在均方值上，再取 rsqrt；不能放到 rsqrt 外部。"},{"title":"无需减均值","body":"RMSNorm 不中心化；照搬 LayerNorm 的均值项会改变数学含义与开销。"}],"questions":[{"q":"融合减少了什么流量？","a":"省去中间 U 的写出与重读，但仍需读取 X 和 R；若下游需要 U，还要增加输出写入。"},{"q":"全零行怎样处理？","a":"epsilon>0 保证倒 RMS 有限，最终输出为 0。"},{"q":"如何支持 FP16 输入、FP32 统计？","a":"加载后提升为 FP32，平方和与归一化保持 FP32，最后按输出契约转换，并重新验证误差。"}],"checklist":["测试全零行、N=1、非整齐列数。","分别对齐 RMSNorm(X) 与 RMSNorm(X+R)。","确认 Residual 不被修改并明确是否需要输出 U。"],"blanks":[{"prompt":"倒尺度是 rsqrt(______ + EPS)。","answer":"square_sum[0] / N","hint":"先求均方值。"},{"prompt":"融合版归一化前的 combined 为 ______。","answer":"X[row, j] + R[row, j]","hint":"残差在归一化之前相加。"}],"references":[{"label":"TileLang 官方核心指令","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/docs/programming_guides/instructions.md"},{"label":"TileLang 官方归约源码","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/tilelang/language/reduce_op.py"},{"label":"TileLang 官方 RMSNorm 示例（学习来源）","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/examples/norm/rms_norm.py"}]},{"id":"P10","module":"M4","title":"RoPE 双布局","subtitle":"相邻配对与前后半区配对必须分清","difficulty":"进阶","minutes":35,"tags":["RoPE","布局","成对旋转"],"statement":"对 X[S,D] 的每个 token 执行二维旋转。输入预计算 Cos/Sin 表，分别支持 interleaved 配对 (2j,2j+1) 和 half-split 配对 (j,j+D/2)。同一输入在两种布局下代表不同配对；布局必须与模型的 Q/K 特征约定一致。","formula":"a′=a·cosθ−b·sinθ；b′=a·sinθ+b·cosθ；θ(pos,j)=pos·10000^(−2j/D)","inputs":"X: [S,D]；Cos、Sin: [S,D/2]；连续 float32 CUDA 张量。","outputs":"Y: [S,D], float32；全部 D 维参与旋转。","constraints":["S>0、D>0 且 D 偶数；只支持 out-of-place 输出。","仅演示单个 Q 或 K 矩阵；batch/head 布局须由调用方明确。","不含 partial rotary、NTK/YaRN、KV cache 管理或 fused Q/K。","Cos/Sin 已按实际 position 构造；host 示例从位置 0 开始。","已核对官方 API 并通过 Python 语法检查；本环境未安装 TileLang/PyTorch，未进行 GPU 编译、正确性运行或性能实测。"],"approach":["将 S×(D/2) 个配对线性展开，每个逻辑迭代处理一对。","factory 阶段确定 STEP、OFFSET，用同一旋转表达式覆盖两种布局。","读取两个原始值和 cos/sin，写回两个输出；边界检查作用于 pair。"],"mapping":[{"cuda":"一个线程负责一对通道","tilelang":"T.Parallel(BLOCK) 处理 pair","why":"分开表达逻辑 pair 与物理线程映射。"},{"cuda":"索引 2j、2j+1","tilelang":"STEP=2、OFFSET=1","why":"相邻通道配对。"},{"cuda":"索引 j、j+D/2","tilelang":"STEP=1、OFFSET=D/2","why":"前后半区配对，不能只换 sin 符号。"}],"versions":[{"name":"v0 · 一份 factory，两种布局","note":"完整脚本；分别对齐参考并检查范数。Cos/Sin 在 host 生成，其三角函数成本不属于本 kernel。已核对官方 API 并通过 Python 语法检查；本环境未安装 TileLang/PyTorch，未进行 GPU 编译、正确性运行或性能实测。","code":"# Status: syntax checked only; not compiled or run on a GPU here.\nimport torch\nimport tilelang\nimport tilelang.language as T\n\n\n@tilelang.jit(target=\"cuda\")\ndef make_rope(S, D, interleaved=True, BLOCK=256):\n    assert S > 0 and D > 0 and D % 2 == 0\n    HALF = D // 2\n    STEP = 2 if interleaved else 1\n    OFFSET = 1 if interleaved else HALF\n\n    @T.prim_func\n    def main(X: T.Tensor((S, D), \"float32\"),\n             Cos: T.Tensor((S, HALF), \"float32\"),\n             Sin: T.Tensor((S, HALF), \"float32\"),\n             Y: T.Tensor((S, D), \"float32\")):\n        with T.Kernel(T.ceildiv(S * HALF, BLOCK), threads=128) as bx:\n            for lane in T.Parallel(BLOCK):\n                pair = bx * BLOCK + lane\n                if pair < S * HALF:\n                    row = pair // HALF\n                    j = pair % HALF\n                    ia = j * STEP\n                    ib = ia + OFFSET\n                    a = X[row, ia]\n                    b = X[row, ib]\n                    c = Cos[row, j]\n                    s = Sin[row, j]\n                    Y[row, ia] = a * c - b * s\n                    Y[row, ib] = a * s + b * c\n    return main\n\n\ndef reference(x, cos, sin, interleaved):\n    if interleaved:\n        a, b = x[:, 0::2], x[:, 1::2]\n        return torch.stack((a * cos - b * sin,\n                            a * sin + b * cos), dim=-1).flatten(-2)\n    a, b = x.chunk(2, dim=-1)\n    return torch.cat((a * cos - b * sin, a * sin + b * cos), -1)\n\n\ndef check(S=17, D=64):\n    x = torch.randn((S, D), device=\"cuda\", dtype=torch.float32)\n    position = torch.arange(S, device=\"cuda\", dtype=torch.float32)\n    j = torch.arange(D // 2, device=\"cuda\", dtype=torch.float32)\n    inverse_frequency = torch.pow(10000.0, -2.0 * j / D)\n    angle = position[:, None] * inverse_frequency[None, :]\n    cos, sin = angle.cos().contiguous(), angle.sin().contiguous()\n    for interleaved in (True, False):\n        y = torch.empty_like(x)\n        make_rope(S, D, interleaved)(x, cos, sin, y)\n        ref = reference(x, cos, sin, interleaved)\n        torch.testing.assert_close(y, ref, rtol=1e-5, atol=1e-6)\n        torch.testing.assert_close(y.square().sum(-1), x.square().sum(-1),\n                                   rtol=1e-5, atol=1e-5)\n        print(f\"passed: interleaved={interleaved}\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    assert torch.cuda.is_available()\n    torch.manual_seed(0)\n    check()\n"}],"pitfalls":[{"title":"频率表与通道布局都要对齐","body":"正确 θ 不能弥补配对索引错误。分别构造两种参考，不能只检查 shape。"},{"title":"旋转符号要成对","body":"一个输出 a·cos−b·sin，另一个 a·sin+b·cos；两处都减号会失去正交性。"},{"title":"position 不总是行号","body":"增量解码可从缓存长度开始，实际位置必须体现在 Cos/Sin 表中。"}],"questions":[{"q":"为何同时作用于 Q 和 K？","a":"两者的相对旋转影响点积，从而引入相对位置信息；本 kernel 可分别用于 Q 与 K。"},{"q":"如何快速发现符号错误？","a":"检查 position=0 为恒等、每对或整行范数保持，再与正确布局参考逐元素比较。"},{"q":"两种布局能随意互换吗？","a":"需同步调整特征排列、权重约定和频率映射，不能在已有模型里直接切换参数。"}],"checklist":["两个布局各自与参考比较。","检查 position=0 恒等与范数保持。","S=17 检查最后一个 pair block 的尾部。"],"blanks":[{"prompt":"interleaved 的配对索引为 (2j, ______)。","answer":"2*j + 1","hint":"相邻两个通道。"},{"prompt":"half-split 中与 j 配对的是 ______。","answer":"j + D//2","hint":"后半区同一相对位置。"}],"references":[{"label":"TileLang 官方核心指令","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/docs/programming_guides/instructions.md"},{"label":"RoFormer 原始论文","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2104.09864"}]},{"id":"P11","module":"M5","title":"Naive Attention","subtitle":"三步算清 QKᵀ、Softmax 与 PV","difficulty":"挑战","minutes":65,"tags":["Attention","GEMM","S² 中间量"],"statement":"实现分阶段、非 causal scaled dot-product attention：QKᵀ 写出分数矩阵，逐行 Softmax 写出概率矩阵，最后乘 V。三个阶段全部使用 TileLang。保留 S×S 中间量以方便验证与比较下一题；naive 指计算图分阶段，不要求使用标量点积。","formula":"Scores=QKᵀ/√D；P=Softmax(Scores)；O=PV；P 转为 FP16 后参与第二次 GEMM。","inputs":"Q、K、V: [S,D]，连续 float16 CUDA 张量；B=H=1，D=64。","outputs":"O: [S,D] float16；临时 Scores[S,S] 为 FP32、P[S,S] 为 FP16。","constraints":["面向 NVIDIA SM80+，需要 CUDA 与 TileLang Tensor Core 编译链。","0<S≤2048、S%64=0、D=64；只处理完整 tile。","非 causal、无 dropout；不支持任意 mask、GQA/MQA、paged KV、变长序列或 backward。","GEMM 输入 FP16、累加 FP32；概率转 FP16 是显式精度边界，不等同于全 FP32 attention。","已核对官方 API 并通过 Python 语法检查；本环境未安装 TileLang/PyTorch，未进行 GPU 编译、正确性运行或性能实测。"],"approach":["QK 使用 64×64 输出 tile，共享内存存 FP16 Q/K，FP32 累加后乘 1/√D。","Softmax 一行一个 block，在 FP32 fragment 中稳定归一化，写出 FP16 概率。","PV 沿 S 维以 64 分块；共享内存加载 P/V，FP32 累加，最后转 FP16 输出。"],"mapping":[{"cuda":"shared-memory tiled QKᵀ","tilelang":"T.copy + T.gemm(..., transpose_B=True)","why":"逻辑转置 K，不必另存转置矩阵。"},{"cuda":"独立 row softmax kernel","tilelang":"第二个 T.prim_func + 两类 reduce","why":"便于分别定位数值与布局错误。"},{"cuda":"沿 S 维循环累加 PV","tilelang":"T.Pipelined + T.gemm(ps,vs,acc)","why":"累加器只在循环前清零。"}],"versions":[{"name":"v0 · 三个 TileLang kernel","note":"完整脚本，逐阶段比较 Scores、P、O，参考显式复现 P→FP16。没有性能实测数据。已核对官方 API 并通过 Python 语法检查；本环境未安装 TileLang/PyTorch，未进行 GPU 编译、正确性运行或性能实测。","code":"# Status: syntax checked only; not compiled or run on a GPU here.\n# B=H=1, D=64, S divisible by 64, non-causal, FP16 Q/K/V.\nimport torch\nimport tilelang\nimport tilelang.language as T\n\n\n@tilelang.jit(target=\"cuda\")\ndef make_qk(S, D=64):\n    assert 0 < S <= 2048 and S % 64 == 0 and D == 64\n    @T.prim_func\n    def main(Q: T.Tensor((S, D), \"float16\"),\n             K: T.Tensor((S, D), \"float16\"),\n             Scores: T.Tensor((S, S), \"float32\")):\n        with T.Kernel(S // 64, S // 64, threads=128) as (kc, qr):\n            qs = T.alloc_shared((64, D), \"float16\")\n            ks = T.alloc_shared((64, D), \"float16\")\n            acc = T.alloc_fragment((64, 64), \"float32\")\n            T.copy(Q[qr * 64, 0], qs)\n            T.copy(K[kc * 64, 0], ks)\n            T.clear(acc)\n            T.gemm(qs, ks, acc, transpose_B=True)\n            for i, j in T.Parallel(64, 64):\n                acc[i, j] *= D ** -0.5\n            T.copy(acc, Scores[qr * 64, kc * 64])\n    return main\n\n\n@tilelang.jit(target=\"cuda\")\ndef make_probability(S):\n    assert 0 < S <= 2048 and S % 64 == 0\n    BLOCK = 1 << (S - 1).bit_length()\n    @T.prim_func\n    def main(Scores: T.Tensor((S, S), \"float32\"),\n             P: T.Tensor((S, S), \"float16\")):\n        with T.Kernel(S, threads=128) as row:\n            v = T.alloc_fragment((1, BLOCK), \"float32\")\n            m = T.alloc_fragment((1,), \"float32\")\n            z = T.alloc_fragment((1,), \"float32\")\n            for j in T.Parallel(BLOCK):\n                v[0, j] = T.if_then_else(\n                    j < S, Scores[row, j], -T.infinity(\"float32\"))\n            T.reduce_max(v, m, dim=1)\n            for j in T.Parallel(BLOCK):\n                v[0, j] = T.exp(v[0, j] - m[0])\n            T.reduce_sum(v, z, dim=1)\n            for j in T.Parallel(BLOCK):\n                if j < S:\n                    P[row, j] = v[0, j] / z[0]\n    return main\n\n\n@tilelang.jit(target=\"cuda\")\ndef make_pv(S, D=64):\n    assert 0 < S <= 2048 and S % 64 == 0 and D == 64\n    @T.prim_func\n    def main(P: T.Tensor((S, S), \"float16\"),\n             V: T.Tensor((S, D), \"float16\"),\n             O: T.Tensor((S, D), \"float16\")):\n        with T.Kernel(S // 64, threads=128) as qr:\n            ps = T.alloc_shared((64, 64), \"float16\")\n            vs = T.alloc_shared((64, D), \"float16\")\n            acc = T.alloc_fragment((64, D), \"float32\")\n            T.clear(acc)\n            for tile in T.Pipelined(S // 64, num_stages=1):\n                T.copy(P[qr * 64, tile * 64], ps)\n                T.copy(V[tile * 64, 0], vs)\n                T.gemm(ps, vs, acc)\n            T.copy(acc, O[qr * 64, 0])\n    return main\n\n\ndef check(S=256, D=64):\n    assert torch.cuda.is_available()\n    torch.backends.cuda.matmul.allow_tf32 = False\n    assert torch.cuda.get_device_capability()[0] >= 8, \"Use SM80+\"\n    q, k, v = [torch.randn((S, D), device=\"cuda\", dtype=torch.float16)\n               for _ in range(3)]\n    scores = torch.empty((S, S), device=\"cuda\", dtype=torch.float32)\n    p = torch.empty((S, S), device=\"cuda\", dtype=torch.float16)\n    out = torch.empty_like(q)\n    qk, sm, pv = make_qk(S, D), make_probability(S), make_pv(S, D)\n    qk(q, k, scores)\n    sm(scores, p)\n    pv(p, v, out)\n    ref_scores = q.float() @ k.float().T / (D ** 0.5)\n    ref_p = torch.softmax(ref_scores, dim=-1)\n    # Match the explicit FP16 probability boundary.\n    ref_out = (ref_p.half().float() @ v.float()).half()\n    torch.testing.assert_close(scores, ref_scores, rtol=2e-3, atol=2e-3)\n    torch.testing.assert_close(p.float(), ref_p, rtol=2e-3, atol=2e-4)\n    torch.testing.assert_close(out, ref_out, rtol=2e-2, atol=2e-2)\n    print(\"three-stage attention passed\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    torch.manual_seed(0)\n    check()\n"}],"pitfalls":[{"title":"缩放只能做一次","body":"1/√D 作用于 QKᵀ 分数再进入 Softmax；忘记缩放或第二次 GEMM 再缩放都改变结果。"},{"title":"矩阵朝向","body":"K 存储仍为 [S,D]，第一步需要 transpose_B=True；PV 是 [S,S]×[S,D]，无需转置。"},{"title":"S² 中间空间","body":"Scores 和 P 约占 6S² 字节临时空间，写出后还要重读；长序列不能只关注 GEMM 算力。"}],"questions":[{"q":"为何先写分阶段版本？","a":"分别验证维度、缩放、精度与输出，形成与融合版本比较的可解释基线。"},{"q":"为什么 P 使用 FP16？","a":"让第二次 T.gemm 使用 FP16 输入和 FP32 累加；它引入量化误差，参考必须包含此边界。"},{"q":"能在每次 KV tile 清零输出 acc 吗？","a":"不能，PV 需沿整个 S 累加，只在循环前清零一次。"}],"checklist":["先比较 Scores，再比较 P，最后比较 O。","核对 FP16 输入、D=64、S%64=0、SM80+。","参考包含概率转换；计时排除编译与内存分配。"],"blanks":[{"prompt":"Q/K 均按 [S,D] 存储，QKᵀ 应传 transpose_B=______。","answer":"True","hint":"逻辑 B 操作数需要转置。"},{"prompt":"PV 的 acc 清零放在 tile 循环的 ______。","answer":"之前","hint":"每个 tile 都贡献输出一部分。"}],"references":[{"label":"TileLang 官方核心指令","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/docs/programming_guides/instructions.md"},{"label":"TileLang 官方归约源码","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/tilelang/language/reduce_op.py"},{"label":"TileLang 官方 GEMM 快速示例","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/examples/quickstart.py"},{"label":"Attention Is All You Need","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.03762"}]},{"id":"P12","module":"M5","title":"Tiled FlashAttention","subtitle":"维护 m、l、O，省掉全局 S² 中间矩阵","difficulty":"挑战","minutes":90,"tags":["Online Softmax","融合 Attention","Tensor Core"],"statement":"固定 query tile，遍历 KV tile，每次计算一块分数并更新 online softmax 状态。不再把完整 Scores 或 P 写入显存。教学实现保留核心数值递推和两次 GEMM，KV 循环串行执行；没有声称替代经过调优的完整 FlashAttention 库。","formula":"m′=max(m,max(s_t))；α=exp(m−m′)；p_t=exp(s_t−m′)；l′=α·l+Σp_t；A′=α·A+p_t·V_t；最终 O=A/l；s_t=Q·K_tᵀ/√D。","inputs":"Q、K、V: [S,64]，连续 float16 CUDA 张量；B=H=1，所有 token 互相可见。","outputs":"O: [S,64] float16；每个 block 只保存当前 tile、输出累加器和行状态。","constraints":["NVIDIA SM80+；BM=BN=D=64，S>0 且 S%64=0。","非 causal、无 dropout、无任意 mask；不支持 GQA/MQA、paged KV、变长、backward。","输入有限且每行至少有一个可见 key；没有全掩码行处理。","Q/K/V 和临时 GEMM 概率输入 FP16；分数、分母、输出累加器 FP32；概率转换引入近似误差。","T.serial KV 循环，没有声称流水线重叠、warp specialization 或达到峰值性能。","已核对官方 API 并通过 Python 语法检查；本环境未安装 TileLang/PyTorch，未进行 GPU 编译、正确性运行或性能实测。"],"approach":["一个 block 固定 64 个 query，在开始时加载 Q。","逐块读取 K/V，计算缩放分数，合并新旧最大值。","用 alpha 同时重标定旧分母与旧输出分子，再累加本块权重和加权 V。","全部 key 处理完后只除一次分母，再写输出；后续可研究 pipeline 与 tile 调优。"],"mapping":[{"cuda":"Q/K/V shared tiles + Tensor Core","tilelang":"T.alloc_shared + T.gemm","why":"显式表达复用层级，编译器处理线程布局与同步。"},{"cuda":"running max / running sum","tilelang":"FP32 fragment + 两类 reduce","why":"行状态随 BM 增长，不需全局 S² 存储。"},{"cuda":"旧输出 accumulator 重标定","tilelang":"out*=alpha 后 T.gemm(ps,vs,out)","why":"保证旧分子与新分子处于同一指数基准。"}],"versions":[{"name":"v0 · 非 causal Online Softmax","note":"完整脚本；依据官方示例原理简化为单 batch/head、固定维度、串行 tile 循环。FP32 参考用于容差比较，不声称逐位一致。已核对官方 API 并通过 Python 语法检查；本环境未安装 TileLang/PyTorch，未进行 GPU 编译、正确性运行或性能实测。","code":"# Status: syntax checked only; not compiled or run on a GPU here.\n# B=H=1, D=64, S divisible by 64, non-causal, NVIDIA SM80+.\nimport torch\nimport tilelang\nimport tilelang.language as T\n\n\n@tilelang.jit(target=\"cuda\")\ndef make_flash_attention(S, D=64):\n    assert S > 0 and S % 64 == 0 and D == 64\n    BM, BN = 64, 64\n    SCALE = D ** -0.5\n\n    @T.prim_func\n    def main(Q: T.Tensor((S, D), \"float16\"),\n             K: T.Tensor((S, D), \"float16\"),\n             V: T.Tensor((S, D), \"float16\"),\n             O: T.Tensor((S, D), \"float16\")):\n        with T.Kernel(S // BM, threads=128) as qb:\n            qs = T.alloc_shared((BM, D), \"float16\")\n            ks = T.alloc_shared((BN, D), \"float16\")\n            vs = T.alloc_shared((BN, D), \"float16\")\n            ps = T.alloc_shared((BM, BN), \"float16\")\n            score = T.alloc_fragment((BM, BN), \"float32\")\n            out = T.alloc_fragment((BM, D), \"float32\")\n            running_m = T.alloc_fragment((BM,), \"float32\")\n            running_l = T.alloc_fragment((BM,), \"float32\")\n            merged_m = T.alloc_fragment((BM,), \"float32\")\n            tile_l = T.alloc_fragment((BM,), \"float32\")\n            alpha = T.alloc_fragment((BM,), \"float32\")\n            T.copy(Q[qb * BM, 0], qs)\n            T.clear(out)\n            T.clear(running_l)\n            T.fill(running_m, -T.infinity(\"float32\"))\n            # Serial loop exposes dependencies of the online state.\n            for kv in T.serial(S // BN):\n                T.copy(K[kv * BN, 0], ks)\n                T.copy(V[kv * BN, 0], vs)\n                T.clear(score)\n                T.gemm(qs, ks, score, transpose_B=True,\n                       policy=T.GemmWarpPolicy.FullRow)\n                for i, j in T.Parallel(BM, BN):\n                    score[i, j] *= SCALE\n                T.reduce_max(score, merged_m, dim=1)\n                for i in T.Parallel(BM):\n                    merged_m[i] = T.max(running_m[i], merged_m[i])\n                    alpha[i] = T.exp(running_m[i] - merged_m[i])\n                for i, j in T.Parallel(BM, BN):\n                    score[i, j] = T.exp(score[i, j] - merged_m[i])\n                T.reduce_sum(score, tile_l, dim=1)\n                for i in T.Parallel(BM):\n                    running_l[i] = alpha[i] * running_l[i] + tile_l[i]\n                    running_m[i] = merged_m[i]\n                # Rescale the old numerator BEFORE adding this tile.\n                for i, d in T.Parallel(BM, D):\n                    out[i, d] *= alpha[i]\n                T.copy(score, ps)  # FP32 weights -> FP16 GEMM input.\n                T.gemm(ps, vs, out, policy=T.GemmWarpPolicy.FullRow)\n            for i, d in T.Parallel(BM, D):\n                out[i, d] /= running_l[i]\n            T.copy(out, O[qb * BM, 0])\n    return main\n\n\ndef check(S=256, D=64):\n    assert torch.cuda.is_available()\n    torch.backends.cuda.matmul.allow_tf32 = False\n    assert torch.cuda.get_device_capability()[0] >= 8, \"Use SM80+\"\n    q, k, v = [torch.randn((S, D), device=\"cuda\", dtype=torch.float16)\n               for _ in range(3)]\n    out = torch.empty_like(q)\n    make_flash_attention(S, D)(q, k, v, out)\n    logits = (q.float() @ k.float().T) / (D ** 0.5)\n    ref = (torch.softmax(logits, -1) @ v.float()).half()\n    # FP16 unnormalized tile weights are an approximation boundary.\n    torch.testing.assert_close(out, ref, rtol=2e-2, atol=2e-2)\n    assert torch.isfinite(out).all()\n    print(\"online attention passed\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    torch.manual_seed(0)\n    check(64)\n    check(256)\n"}],"pitfalls":[{"title":"只更新分母不够","body":"最大值变为 m′ 时，旧分母 l 和旧分子 A 都要乘 exp(m−m′)；漏掉其中一个会改变最终比值。"},{"title":"不能逐块归一化后直接相加","body":"局部 Softmax 各自除以局部分母后相加，不等于全局 Softmax。应累加共同基准下的未归一化分子，最后除一次。"},{"title":"exp 与 exp2 的底数","body":"本代码统一 exp。换 exp2 时分数及最大值差都要乘 log2(e)，alpha 与本块权重必须一致。"},{"title":"概率 FP16 边界","body":"分母按 FP32 求和，第二次 GEMM 的权重为 FP16。应实测误差，不能把容差检查描述为逐位等价。"}],"questions":[{"q":"为什么不再需要 S² 空间？","a":"分数与概率只保留当前 BM×BN tile，行状态为 BM，输出累加器为 BM×D；全局只需输入与输出。"},{"q":"新 tile 出现更大分数，旧结果怎么办？","a":"将旧分母和旧分子同时乘 exp(m−m′)，换到新基准，再加入 exp(s−m′) 的贡献。"},{"q":"如何扩展 causal？","a":"按 query/key 全局位置屏蔽未来 key 并限制遍历范围；还要处理尾部、全掩码行、−Inf 指数差，不能只给输出乘三角 mask。"}],"checklist":["S=64 验证单 tile，S=256 验证多 tile。","检查 running_l 与旧 out 都乘 alpha，且 out 重标定在 GEMM 前。","对比 FP32 参考，记录 GPU、版本、dtype、误差与计时口径。"],"blanks":[{"prompt":"最大值更新后，旧分子必须先乘 ______。","answer":"T.exp(running_m[i] - merged_m[i])","hint":"将旧指数基准换算到新基准。"},{"prompt":"最终输出的分母是 ______。","answer":"running_l[i]","hint":"所有 KV tile 在共同基准下的权重和。"}],"references":[{"label":"TileLang 官方核心指令","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/docs/programming_guides/instructions.md"},{"label":"TileLang 官方归约源码","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/tilelang/language/reduce_op.py"},{"label":"TileLang 官方 FlashAttention 示例（学习来源）","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/examples/flash_attention/example_mha_fwd_bshd.py"},{"label":"FlashAttention 原始论文","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.14135"},{"label":"FlashAttention-2 论文","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.08691"}]},{"id":"P13","module":"M5","title":"Decode Attention","subtitle":"从一个 query 理解 KV 读取、稳定 softmax 与加权归约","difficulty":"挑战","minutes":50,"tags":["Attention","Decode","Softmax","归约"],"statement":"实现一个 batch、一个 attention head、一个 query 的 decode attention。Q 是 D 维向量，连续存储的 K、V 各包含 S 个历史 token。输出为 softmax(QKᵀ/√D)V。基础实现用一个 block 完成全部计算，不把分数矩阵写回全局内存。它用于解释语义和数据流；长上下文、分页 KV、GQA 和 split-KV 需进一步设计。","formula":"score[s] = Σd Q[d]·K[s,d]/√D；p[s] = exp(score[s]−max(score))/Σt exp(score[t]−max(score))；O[d] = Σs p[s]·V[s,d]","inputs":"Q:[D]、K:[S,D]、V:[S,D]，连续 row-major FP32 CUDA 张量；B=H=1。","outputs":"O:[D] FP32。","constraints":["1≤S≤256，D∈{32,64}；S、D 在编译时固定。","输入为有限、幅度适中的数值，点积与加权和不发生 FP32 溢出。","Q 代表当前 token，K/V 已包含所有可见 token，不额外构造 causal mask。","代码未实现分页地址计算、GQA、split-KV 或长序列在线 softmax。","当前环境只检查 Python 语法，未完成 TileLang 编译、GPU 正确性或性能实测。"],"approach":["按 D 归约每个 Q·K 乘积，得到 S 个分数；padding 分数必须是 −∞。","先减最大分数再取指数，按 S 归约分母；有效 token 至少一个，分母大于零。","归一化后的概率乘 V，再按 S 归约输出 D 维向量。","单 block 版本保留完整 score tile，S 增大会提高寄存器压力。长上下文可按 KV tile 流式更新 running max、分母和未归一化输出。","split-KV 的每段返回 (m,l,o)：合并时 m=max(mj)，l=Σexp(mj−m)lj，o=Σexp(mj−m)oj，最后 o/l。分页只改变逻辑 token 到物理 KV 页的寻址，合并规则不变。"],"mapping":[{"cuda":"一个 CTA 处理一条 query","tilelang":"T.Kernel(1, threads=128)","why":"基础版本将跨 token 的同步限制在一个 block 内。"},{"cuda":"手写 dot product、warp/block reduction","tilelang":"T.Parallel + T.reduce_sum","why":"分别沿 head dimension 和序列维表达不同的归约。"},{"cuda":"score 的 max/sum 与 exp","tilelang":"T.reduce_max、T.exp、T.reduce_sum","why":"稳定 softmax 的顺序保持明确。"}],"versions":[{"name":"v0 · 单 query / 单 block","note":"完整 FP32 教学实现；覆盖非二次幂 S。Python 语法已检查，GPU 编译与运行待验证。","code":"import math\nimport torch\nimport tilelang\nimport tilelang.language as T\n\n\ndef make_decode_attention(S, D):\n    # 教学范围：一个 batch、一个 head、一条 query。\n    assert 1 <= S <= 256 and D in (32, 64)\n    BS = 1 << (S - 1).bit_length()\n    inv_sqrt_d = 1.0 / math.sqrt(D)\n\n    @T.prim_func\n    def main(\n        Q: T.Tensor((D,), \"float32\"),\n        K: T.Tensor((S, D), \"float32\"),\n        V: T.Tensor((S, D), \"float32\"),\n        O: T.Tensor((D,), \"float32\"),\n    ):\n        with T.Kernel(1, threads=128):\n            qk = T.alloc_fragment((BS, D), \"float32\")\n            scores = T.alloc_fragment((BS,), \"float32\")\n            m = T.alloc_fragment((1,), \"float32\")\n            denom = T.alloc_fragment((1,), \"float32\")\n            weighted = T.alloc_fragment((BS, D), \"float32\")\n            out = T.alloc_fragment((D,), \"float32\")\n\n            # 每个有效 key 与唯一 query 做点积。\n            for s, d in T.Parallel(BS, D):\n                if s < S:\n                    qk[s, d] = Q[d] * K[s, d]\n                else:\n                    qk[s, d] = 0.0\n            T.reduce_sum(qk, scores, dim=1, clear=True)\n            for s in T.Parallel(BS):\n                if s < S:\n                    scores[s] = scores[s] * inv_sqrt_d\n                else:\n                    scores[s] = -T.infinity(\"float32\")\n\n            # 稳定 softmax；padding 对分母贡献为零。\n            T.reduce_max(scores, m, dim=0, clear=True)\n            for s in T.Parallel(BS):\n                scores[s] = T.exp(scores[s] - m[0])\n            T.reduce_sum(scores, denom, dim=0, clear=True)\n            for s in T.Parallel(BS):\n                scores[s] = scores[s] / denom[0]\n\n            # 对序列维求加权和，得到一个 D 维输出。\n            for s, d in T.Parallel(BS, D):\n                if s < S:\n                    weighted[s, d] = scores[s] * V[s, d]\n                else:\n                    weighted[s, d] = 0.0\n            T.reduce_sum(weighted, out, dim=0, clear=True)\n            T.copy(out, O)\n\n    return tilelang.compile(main, out_idx=None, target=\"cuda\")\n\n\ndef main():\n    torch.manual_seed(0)\n    for S, D in [(1, 32), (127, 64), (256, 64)]:\n        q = torch.randn(D, device=\"cuda\")\n        k = torch.randn(S, D, device=\"cuda\")\n        v = torch.randn(S, D, device=\"cuda\")\n        out = torch.empty(D, device=\"cuda\")\n        kernel = make_decode_attention(S, D)\n        kernel(q, k, v, out)\n        # FP64 reference 降低 reference 自身归约误差。\n        score = (k.double() @ q.double()) / math.sqrt(D)\n        ref = (torch.softmax(score, dim=0) @ v.double()).float()\n        torch.testing.assert_close(out, ref, rtol=2e-4, atol=2e-5)\n    print(\"Decode attention checks passed\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"}],"pitfalls":[{"title":"把 padding 分数设为零","body":"零也会进入 softmax，改变分母和结果。点积 padding 可以填零，但 softmax 前的 padding score 要改成 −∞。"},{"title":"每段 softmax 后直接相加","body":"不同 KV 段的最大值和分母不同，局部概率不处于同一归一化尺度。split-KV 必须携带 max、sum 和未归一化输出再合并。"},{"title":"把一条 query 的结果当成吞吐结论","body":"只有一个 CTA 很难让 GPU 充分并行。应区分延迟示例与多 batch、多 head 的真实吞吐，并记录 S、D、数据类型。"}],"questions":[{"q":"为什么 decode 常常受 KV 读取影响？","a":"每次只新增少量 query，却要读取已有 token 的 K/V。算术复用随形状和 batching 改变，应结合实际读字节数和算力分析。"},{"q":"这个版本为什么没有 causal mask？","a":"输入 K/V 被定义为当前 query 可见的完整历史区间；如果含未来 token，需要显式屏蔽。"},{"q":"连续 KV 如何扩展到 paged attention？","a":"加入 block table，将 token 下标拆成逻辑页号和页内偏移，再查物理页。softmax 和 split 合并公式保持一致。"}],"checklist":["验证 S=1、非二次幂 S 与最大教学形状。","检查 padding 概率为零，所有有效概率之和接近一。","针对目标 GPU 检查寄存器占用，再决定在线分块或 split-KV。"],"blanks":[{"prompt":"softmax 前，越界 token 的 score 应填什么？","answer":"-T.infinity(\"float32\")","hint":"使其指数贡献为零。"},{"prompt":"两个 KV 分段的统计量合并时，局部分母要乘什么权重？","answer":"exp(m_j - m)，其中 m=max_j(m_j)","hint":"先对齐各段的指数尺度。"}],"references":[{"label":"TileLang 官方：Language Basics","url":"https://www.tilelang.com/programming_guides/language_basics.html"},{"label":"TileLang 官方：Instructions","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/docs/programming_guides/instructions.md"},{"label":"TileLang 官方：归约 API 源码","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/tilelang/language/reduce_op.py"}]},{"id":"P14","module":"M6","title":"GEMM","subtitle":"FP16 Tensor Core 乘法，FP32 累加和输出","difficulty":"挑战","minutes":55,"tags":["GEMM","Tensor Core","Shared Memory","Pipeline"],"statement":"实现 C=A×B。A、B 为连续 row-major FP16，累加和输出为 FP32。先选定规则 tile，把一个输出 tile 的 K 方向循环写清，再用两阶段流水表达数据搬运与计算的重叠。本题不把低精度乘法命名为纯 FP32 SGEMM。","formula":"C[m,n] = Σk float32(A[m,k])·float32(B[k,n])；A、B 的存储类型为 FP16","inputs":"A:[M,K] FP16，B:[K,N] FP16；同一 CUDA 设备上的连续 row-major 张量。","outputs":"C:[M,N] FP32。","constraints":["BM=BN=64，BK=32；M、N 是 64 的正整数倍，K 是 32 的正整数倍。","目标 GPU 和 CUDA 工具链应支持所选 FP16 Tensor Core 路径；具体 MMA 指令以生成源码为准。","此实现没有尾块处理、转置输入、bias、activation 或 split-K。","FP16 输入、FP32 累加不等于 FP32 输入的 SGEMM；对比必须统一输入、输出精度与容差。","Python 语法已检查；当前环境没有 TileLang/PyTorch GPU 运行结果。"],"approach":["把输出矩阵划成 64×64 tile，一个 block 负责一个 tile。","每轮把 64×32 的 A 子块和 32×64 的 B 子块拷贝到共享内存，再用 T.gemm 累加。","累加器在 K 循环之前清零，K 循环之后只写回一次。","T.Pipelined(num_stages=2) 表达两阶段流水意图；是否实现有效重叠，要看生成代码与实测。","调优时比较 tile 大小、BK、线程数和流水级数对数据复用、共享内存和寄存器资源的共同影响。"],"mapping":[{"cuda":"blockIdx.x/y 定位输出子矩阵","tilelang":"T.Kernel(N//BN, M//BM)","why":"输出 tile 与二维 grid 直接对应。"},{"cuda":"共享内存 A/B tile + MMA accumulator","tilelang":"T.alloc_shared + T.alloc_fragment + T.gemm","why":"明确数据暂存位置与 FP32 累加类型。"},{"cuda":"双缓冲或异步预取流水","tilelang":"T.Pipelined(..., num_stages=2)","why":"由编译器组织流水，仍需验证实际同步和资源开销。"}],"versions":[{"name":"v0 · 64×64×32 分块与两阶段流水","note":"完整 FP16→FP32 GEMM；限制规则整块形状。语法已检查，GPU 编译和性能待验证。","code":"import torch\nimport tilelang\nimport tilelang.language as T\n\n\ndef make_gemm(M, N, K):\n    # FP16 输入、FP32 累加和输出；不是纯 FP32 SGEMM。\n    BM, BN, BK = 64, 64, 32\n    assert M > 0 and N > 0 and K > 0\n    assert M % BM == 0 and N % BN == 0 and K % BK == 0\n\n    @T.prim_func\n    def main(\n        A: T.Tensor((M, K), \"float16\"),\n        B: T.Tensor((K, N), \"float16\"),\n        C: T.Tensor((M, N), \"float32\"),\n    ):\n        with T.Kernel(N // BN, M // BM, threads=128) as (bx, by):\n            a_s = T.alloc_shared((BM, BK), \"float16\")\n            b_s = T.alloc_shared((BK, BN), \"float16\")\n            acc = T.alloc_fragment((BM, BN), \"float32\")\n\n            # 整个 K 方向共同累加到同一块 FP32 寄存器。\n            T.clear(acc)\n            for ko in T.Pipelined(K // BK, num_stages=2):\n                T.copy(A[by * BM, ko * BK], a_s)\n                T.copy(B[ko * BK, bx * BN], b_s)\n                # Tensor Core MMA 的具体选择由目标 GPU 和编译器决定。\n                T.gemm(a_s, b_s, acc)\n            T.copy(acc, C[by * BM, bx * BN])\n\n    return tilelang.compile(main, out_idx=None, target=\"cuda\")\n\n\ndef main():\n    torch.manual_seed(0)\n    # reference 不通过 TF32 降低乘法精度。\n    torch.backends.cuda.matmul.allow_tf32 = False\n    for M, N, K in [(64, 64, 32), (256, 256, 128)]:\n        a = (torch.randn(M, K, device=\"cuda\") * 0.2).half()\n        b = (torch.randn(K, N, device=\"cuda\") * 0.2).half()\n        c = torch.empty(M, N, device=\"cuda\", dtype=torch.float32)\n        kernel = make_gemm(M, N, K)\n        kernel(a, b, c)\n        # 对相同的、已经量化为 FP16 的输入计算 reference。\n        ref = a.float() @ b.float()\n        torch.testing.assert_close(c, ref, rtol=2e-3, atol=2e-4)\n        print(f\"checked M={M}, N={N}, K={K}\")\n\n    # 在目标 GPU 上可检查生成源码中的 MMA/WGMMA 指令。\n    # print(kernel.get_kernel_source())\n    # 测速前先编译并预热；本脚本不填入预设吞吐量。\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"}],"pitfalls":[{"title":"在 K 循环内清空累加器","body":"这样最终只保留最后一个 K tile 的乘积。累加器只在整个 K 循环之前清零。"},{"title":"拿不同精度的结果算加速比","body":"FP16 Tensor Core 与 FP32 CUDA core、TF32 的精度和计算路径不同。报告应写明 A/B、累加器和输出类型。"},{"title":"流水越深越快","body":"更多 stage 需要更多共享内存，可能降低 occupancy。对这个 tile 的最优 stage 必须结合 GPU 与 K 实测。"}],"questions":[{"q":"为什么把 A/B 放在共享内存？","a":"同一个 tile 的数据会被多个输出元素复用，同时为 Tensor Core 操作提供合适的操作数存储。"},{"q":"C 是 FP32 就意味着乘法也是 FP32 吗？","a":"不是。本题输入已量化为 FP16，乘法路径使用这些 FP16 值，再用 FP32 累加。"},{"q":"什么时候考虑 split-K？","a":"当 M/N 产生的输出 tile 太少、K 很长时，可以拆分 K 提高并行度；代价是额外部分和、归约与数值顺序变化。"}],"checklist":["核对 A:[M,K]、B:[K,N] 的维度和 row-major 布局。","比较同一 FP16 输入对应的 FP32 reference，并说明误差容差。","在目标 GPU 检查 MMA 指令、共享内存和寄存器，再执行统一口径测速。"],"blanks":[{"prompt":"本题累加器应分配为什么类型？","answer":"T.alloc_fragment((BM, BN), \"float32\")","hint":"输入与累加器不必使用相同精度。"},{"prompt":"整个 K 方向的累加器应在何时清零？","answer":"在 K 循环之前清零一次。","hint":"每轮 T.gemm 都要保留已有部分和。"}],"references":[{"label":"TileLang 官方：GEMM 示例","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/examples/gemm/example_gemm.py"},{"label":"TileLang 官方：Instructions","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/docs/programming_guides/instructions.md"},{"label":"TileLang 官方：Language Basics","url":"https://www.tilelang.com/programming_guides/language_basics.html"}]},{"id":"P15","module":"M6","title":"GEMV","subtitle":"连续列访问与一行一个 block 的 FP32 点积","difficulty":"进阶","minutes":30,"tags":["GEMV","FP32","归约","Memory Bound"],"statement":"实现 FP32 矩阵向量乘 Y=A·X。A 按 row-major 存储，一个 block 处理一行并沿列归约。教学版覆盖非二次幂 N，通过 padding 和边界保护保持点积正确。","formula":"Y[m] = Σn A[m,n]·X[n]","inputs":"A:[M,N]、X:[N]，连续 FP32 CUDA 张量。","outputs":"Y:[M] FP32。","constraints":["M>0，1≤N≤4096，M/N 在编译时固定。","输入为有限数，乘积与归约结果在 FP32 范围内。","代码为一行一个 block 的基础版，未实现 split-N 或跨行共享 X 的专门调度。","浮点归约顺序可能不同，验证使用容差而非逐位相同。","仅完成 Python 语法检查，GPU 编译和运行需要目标环境验证。"],"approach":["BN 取不小于 N 的最小二次幂，便于表达规则的归约 tile。","并行计算 A[row,col]·X[col]；无效列明确写零。","T.reduce_sum 沿列维归约，每行只写一个结果，无需原子操作。","先利用连续列的合并访问；X 被多行使用时，缓存或共享内存复用是否有益需要测量。","当 M 太小而 N 很长时，可拆分列维并使用第二阶段归约增加并行度。"],"mapping":[{"cuda":"blockIdx.x 选择矩阵行","tilelang":"T.Kernel(M) as row","why":"每个 block 拥有独立输出，不存在写冲突。"},{"cuda":"线程跨连续列读取并做局部乘法","tilelang":"T.Parallel(BN)","why":"编译器根据 fragment 布局分配列元素。"},{"cuda":"warp shuffle + block reduction","tilelang":"T.reduce_sum(products, total, dim=0)","why":"直接表达点积的归约维。"}],"versions":[{"name":"v0 · 每行一个 block","note":"完整 FP32 GEMV；支持 N 的尾部 padding。Python 语法已检查，GPU 编译与测试待验证。","code":"import torch\nimport tilelang\nimport tilelang.language as T\n\n\ndef make_gemv(M, N):\n    # 一个 block 负责一行；完整归约列维。\n    assert M > 0 and 1 <= N <= 4096\n    BN = 1 << (N - 1).bit_length()\n\n    @T.prim_func\n    def main(\n        A: T.Tensor((M, N), \"float32\"),\n        X: T.Tensor((N,), \"float32\"),\n        Y: T.Tensor((M,), \"float32\"),\n    ):\n        with T.Kernel(M, threads=128) as row:\n            products = T.alloc_fragment((BN,), \"float32\")\n            total = T.alloc_fragment((1,), \"float32\")\n\n            # row-major A 的连续列由并行循环处理。\n            # padding 必须填 sum 的单位元零。\n            for col in T.Parallel(BN):\n                if col < N:\n                    products[col] = A[row, col] * X[col]\n                else:\n                    products[col] = 0.0\n            T.reduce_sum(products, total, dim=0, clear=True)\n            for i in T.Parallel(1):\n                Y[row] = total[i]\n\n    return tilelang.compile(main, out_idx=None, target=\"cuda\")\n\n\ndef main():\n    torch.manual_seed(0)\n    for M, N in [(1, 1), (37, 1000), (128, 4096)]:\n        a = torch.randn(M, N, device=\"cuda\")\n        x = torch.randn(N, device=\"cuda\")\n        y = torch.empty(M, device=\"cuda\")\n        kernel = make_gemv(M, N)\n        kernel(a, x, y)\n\n        # 用 FP64 点积检查 FP32 归约，允许合理的加法次序误差。\n        ref = (a.double() @ x.double()).float()\n        torch.testing.assert_close(y, ref, rtol=1e-4, atol=3e-4)\n        assert y.shape == (M,)\n        assert y.dtype == torch.float32\n        print(f\"checked M={M}, N={N}\")\n\n    # 若 M 很小而 N 很长，再设计多 block 的分段归约。\n    # 这份基础版本无需全局原子操作或额外归约 kernel。\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"}],"pitfalls":[{"title":"padding 使用未初始化寄存器","body":"sum 会把所有 BN 个元素纳入归约。越界列必须写零，不能只跳过赋值。"},{"title":"先做转置让线程跨行访问","body":"题目 A 是 row-major，同一行连续列更容易形成合并读取。改变映射前要明确真实 stride。"},{"title":"把 GEMM 的复用直觉直接套过来","body":"一条 X 与每行只产生一个标量，不具备大 GEMM 输出 tile 的二维复用。是否需要共享内存应按流量和复用次数判断。"}],"questions":[{"q":"GEMV 为什么通常比 GEMM 更容易受带宽影响？","a":"每个矩阵元素只贡献一次乘加，A 的复用很少。忽略 X/Y 的小量流量时，每读取四字节 A 大约做两次浮点运算。"},{"q":"N 很大时为什么不无限增大 BN？","a":"fragment 更大，寄存器和编译成本增加；若有溢出到 local memory，实际流量也会增加。"},{"q":"M=1 时如何利用更多 SM？","a":"把 N 拆成多个 block 的部分点积，再用第二个 kernel 合并；需要权衡额外启动与部分和流量。"}],"checklist":["用 N=1、非二次幂 N 和最大教学 N 检查边界。","验证 X/Y 的形状、dtype、设备与连续性。","将编译与分配移出计时，分别观察小 M 和大 M 的行为。"],"blanks":[{"prompt":"点积的无效列应使用什么 padding 值？","answer":"0.0","hint":"求和的单位元。"},{"prompt":"一个 block 处理一行时，grid 应有多少个 block？","answer":"M","hint":"每个 block 写出一个 Y[row]。"}],"references":[{"label":"TileLang 官方：归约 API 源码","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/tilelang/language/reduce_op.py"},{"label":"TileLang 官方：Language Basics","url":"https://www.tilelang.com/programming_guides/language_basics.html"},{"label":"TileLang 官方：Instructions","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/docs/programming_guides/instructions.md"}]},{"id":"P16","module":"M7","title":"TopK","subtitle":"小 K 迭代 argmax，明确相等值的下标规则","difficulty":"进阶","minutes":40,"tags":["TopK","Argmax","Tie Breaking","归约"],"statement":"对每一行返回最大的 K 个值及其原始列下标，按值降序排列；值相等时，原始列下标较小的元素优先。基础实现用 K 次 argmax，不进行完整排序，适合解释小 K 选择与重复值处理。","formula":"第 r 轮：v=max(work)；i=min{j | work[j]=v}；输出(v,i)，只把 work[i] 置为 −∞","inputs":"X:[M,N] FP32；所有输入必须是有限数。","outputs":"Values:[M,K] FP32，Indices:[M,K] int32；降序，ties 取小下标。","constraints":["M>0，1≤N≤2048，1≤K≤min(8,N)。","不支持 NaN、+∞、−∞；−∞ 是内部删除及 padding 的哨兵。","索引为原始列下标，相等值按下标升序稳定选择。","该方法进行约 O(K·N) 工作，K 变大后应考虑其他选择策略。","Python 语法已检查；当前环境未做 GPU 编译或运行。"],"approach":["将每行有效值载入 fragment，padding 写 −∞。","每轮先归约最大值，再为等于最大值的位置构造原始下标；其他位置填 BN。","对候选下标求最小值，完成确定性的 first-index tie breaking。","写出值和下标后只删除一个选中的位置，保留其他相等值。","K 大时迭代归约成本上升，可研究局部选择后合并、分桶或基于排序网络的策略。"],"mapping":[{"cuda":"max-value block reduction","tilelang":"T.reduce_max(work, best)","why":"一次归约确定当前剩余最大值。"},{"cuda":"argmax 的 tie breaking","tilelang":"候选下标 fragment + T.reduce_min","why":"避免依赖未规定的线程归约顺序。"},{"cuda":"屏蔽已经选中的元素","tilelang":"仅令 work[first] = −∞","why":"保留其他位置上的重复值。"}],"versions":[{"name":"v0 · K 次确定性 argmax","note":"完整值/下标输出，含重复值与非二次幂 N 测试。语法已检查，GPU 运行待验证。","code":"import torch\nimport tilelang\nimport tilelang.language as T\n\n\ndef make_topk(M, N, K):\n    # 有限 FP32 输入，小 K；相同值优先选择原始下标较小者。\n    assert M > 0 and 1 <= N <= 2048\n    assert 1 <= K <= min(8, N)\n    BN = 1 << (N - 1).bit_length()\n\n    @T.prim_func\n    def main(\n        X: T.Tensor((M, N), \"float32\"),\n        Values: T.Tensor((M, K), \"float32\"),\n        Indices: T.Tensor((M, K), \"int32\"),\n    ):\n        with T.Kernel(M, threads=128) as row:\n            work = T.alloc_fragment((BN,), \"float32\")\n            candidates = T.alloc_fragment((BN,), \"int32\")\n            best = T.alloc_fragment((1,), \"float32\")\n            first = T.alloc_fragment((1,), \"int32\")\n\n            for col in T.Parallel(BN):\n                if col < N:\n                    work[col] = X[row, col]\n                else:\n                    work[col] = -T.infinity(\"float32\")\n\n            for rank in T.serial(K):\n                T.reduce_max(work, best, dim=0, clear=True)\n                # 先归约值，再在等于最大值的位置中选最小下标。\n                for col in T.Parallel(BN):\n                    candidates[col] = T.if_then_else(\n                        work[col] == best[0], col, BN\n                    )\n                T.reduce_min(candidates, first, dim=0, clear=True)\n                for i in T.Parallel(1):\n                    Values[row, rank] = best[i]\n                    Indices[row, rank] = first[i]\n                # 只删除被选中的位置，重复值可在下一轮继续入选。\n                for col in T.Parallel(BN):\n                    if col == first[0]:\n                        work[col] = -T.infinity(\"float32\")\n\n    return tilelang.compile(main, out_idx=None, target=\"cuda\")\n\n\ndef main():\n    torch.manual_seed(0)\n    M, N, K = 17, 513, 8\n    # 有意生成大量 ties，并增加整行相等的样例。\n    x = torch.randint(-8, 9, (M, N), device=\"cuda\").float()\n    x[0].fill_(3.0)\n    values = torch.empty(M, K, device=\"cuda\")\n    indices = torch.empty(M, K, device=\"cuda\", dtype=torch.int32)\n    make_topk(M, N, K)(x, values, indices)\n\n    ref_idx = torch.argsort(x, dim=1, descending=True, stable=True)[:, :K]\n    ref_values = torch.gather(x, 1, ref_idx)\n    torch.testing.assert_close(values, ref_values, rtol=0, atol=0)\n    torch.testing.assert_close(indices, ref_idx.int(), rtol=0, atol=0)\n    print(\"TopK values, indices and tie rule checked\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"}],"pitfalls":[{"title":"删除所有等于最大值的位置","body":"TopK 选择的是元素而非不同数值。删除所有重复最大值会漏掉应该入选的元素。"},{"title":"用不稳定 reference 比较下标","body":"torch.topk 对相等值下标的选择不适合作为本题规则的依据。这里使用 stable=True 的降序 argsort 构造 reference。"},{"title":"允许输入 −∞ 却沿用相同哨兵","body":"真实 −∞、被删除元素和 padding 无法区分。扩展输入域时需要单独的有效标记，或按 value/index pair 做严格选择。"}],"questions":[{"q":"为什么不只求 max 的归约位置？","a":"还需明确相等值规则。两次归约把值比较和下标比较拆开，语义直接，代价也清楚。"},{"q":"K=8 时是否一定比排序快？","a":"不能直接断言。迭代两次归约的同步代价、N、数据分布和 GPU 都会影响结果，应与同语义排序方案测量。"},{"q":"如何支持 Inf 或 NaN？","a":"先定义排序规则，再加入独立有效掩码和相应比较器，避免把合法输入与内部哨兵混淆。"}],"checklist":["测试整行相等、重复最大值、负值与 N 非二次幂。","同时核对值、原始下标和 tie breaking。","验证 K≤N，并确认每个有效位置最多被选一次。"],"blanks":[{"prompt":"与最大值相等的候选中，应对原始下标执行什么归约？","answer":"T.reduce_min","hint":"本题相等值优先小下标。"},{"prompt":"选中一个最大值后，应删除哪些位置？","answer":"只删除本轮选中的一个原始位置。","hint":"其他重复最大值仍可在下一轮入选。"}],"references":[{"label":"TileLang 官方：归约 API 源码","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/tilelang/language/reduce_op.py"},{"label":"TileLang 官方：Instructions","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/docs/programming_guides/instructions.md"},{"label":"TileLang 官方：Language Basics","url":"https://www.tilelang.com/programming_guides/language_basics.html"}]},{"id":"P17","module":"M7","title":"Sort","subtitle":"用双共享缓冲写清 bitonic 比较交换","difficulty":"挑战","minutes":50,"tags":["Sort","Bitonic","Shared Memory","同步"],"statement":"对每行 FP32 数值做升序排序。N 为二次幂，一行由一个 block 完成。采用 bitonic sorting network，每轮从共享缓冲 a 读取全部旧值，写入缓冲 b；同步后再把 b 复制回 a。代码优先让数据依赖和同步可审查。","formula":"width=2^level；stride=2^(level−1−phase)；partner=i xor stride；依方向位保留 min 或 max","inputs":"X:[M,N] FP32，连续 row-major CUDA 张量，元素有限。","outputs":"Y:[M,N] FP32，逐行升序值；不返回索引，不承诺稳定排序。","constraints":["M>0，N 是 2 的幂，1≤N≤1024。","只定义有限 FP32 数值的值排序，不支持 NaN 排序规则。","每个 block 使用两个 N 元素 FP32 共享缓冲，约 8N 字节。","非二次幂 N 需另加 padding 与裁剪；本实现不隐式接受该输入。","已做 Python 语法检查，尚未进行 GPU 编译、race 检测或性能实测。"],"approach":["将一行读入 a；level 逐步扩大 bitonic 合并段宽度。","每个 phase 根据 stride 找配对元素。用整除和奇偶判断表达 partner 与方向位，等价于 XOR 网络。","所有输出位置都读同一个旧 a 快照，各自只写 b[i]，避免原地跨线程读写冲突。","在 b 完成后同步，复制 b 到 a，再同步后开始下一轮比较。","O(N·log²N) 的比较和多次同步适合作为中小行教学基线；更快版本可研究 warp shuffle、分段网络和减少共享拷贝。"],"mapping":[{"cuda":"共享内存中的 compare-exchange","tilelang":"T.alloc_shared + T.Parallel","why":"同一个旧 tile 上的配对读取与唯一写入保持明确。"},{"cuda":"i xor stride","tilelang":"按 stride 分组的奇偶分支，选择 i+stride 或 i−stride","why":"表达同一配对关系，且无需原地交换。"},{"cuda":"每轮比较后的 __syncthreads()","tilelang":"T.sync_threads()","why":"所有线程必须完成本轮数据生产才能进入下一轮。"}],"versions":[{"name":"v0 · bitonic 双缓冲基础版","note":"完整逐行值排序；显式同步、防止同轮原地覆盖。语法已检查，GPU 编译和并发检查待验证。","code":"import torch\nimport tilelang\nimport tilelang.language as T\n\n\ndef make_row_sort(M, N):\n    # 仅升序值排序；N 为 2 的幂，输入不含 NaN/Inf。\n    assert M > 0 and 1 <= N <= 1024 and (N & (N - 1)) == 0\n    LOG_N = N.bit_length() - 1\n\n    @T.prim_func\n    def main(\n        X: T.Tensor((M, N), \"float32\"),\n        Y: T.Tensor((M, N), \"float32\"),\n    ):\n        with T.Kernel(M, threads=128) as row:\n            a = T.alloc_shared((N,), \"float32\")\n            b = T.alloc_shared((N,), \"float32\")\n            T.copy(X[row, 0], a)\n            T.sync_threads()\n\n            for level in T.serial(1, LOG_N + 1):\n                width = (T.int32(1) << level)\n                for phase in T.serial(level):\n                    stride = (T.int32(1) << (level - 1 - phase))\n                    # 这一轮 a 是只读快照，b 是每个位置唯一的写入目标。\n                    for i in T.Parallel(N):\n                        partner = T.if_then_else(\n                            (i // stride) % 2 == 0,\n                            i + stride,\n                            i - stride,\n                        )\n                        # 等价于 bitonic 的方向位和 pair 内高低位比较。\n                        keep_min = (i // width) % 2 == (i // stride) % 2\n                        if keep_min:\n                            b[i] = T.min(a[i], a[partner])\n                        else:\n                            b[i] = T.max(a[i], a[partner])\n\n                    # 全部 b 完成之后才覆盖 a。\n                    T.sync_threads()\n                    for i in T.Parallel(N):\n                        a[i] = b[i]\n                    # 全部 a 完成之后才进入下一轮比较。\n                    T.sync_threads()\n\n            T.copy(a, Y[row, 0])\n\n    return tilelang.compile(main, out_idx=None, target=\"cuda\")\n\n\ndef main():\n    torch.manual_seed(0)\n    for M, N in [(3, 1), (7, 32), (17, 512)]:\n        # 重复值和负数同样参与排序；不承诺元素稳定性。\n        x = torch.randint(-20, 21, (M, N), device=\"cuda\").float()\n        y = torch.empty_like(x)\n        make_row_sort(M, N)(x, y)\n        ref = torch.sort(x, dim=1).values\n        torch.testing.assert_close(y, ref, rtol=0, atol=0)\n        if N > 1:\n            assert bool(torch.all(y[:, 1:] >= y[:, :-1]))\n        print(f\"checked M={M}, N={N}\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"}],"pitfalls":[{"title":"每个线程直接更新 a[i]","body":"线程读 partner 时，对方可能已写入新值，导致读取混合了前后两轮状态。双缓冲让每轮的源保持只读。"},{"title":"把 barrier 放在条件分支里","body":"T.sync_threads 是 block 级同步。不同线程条件不一致时不能让部分线程跳过 barrier。这里所有同步均处于统一循环路径。"},{"title":"只检查结果单调","body":"单调并不保证元素完整，错误 kernel 可能复制最小值并丢失其他值。必须与完整 reference 比较，检查值的多重集合。"}],"questions":[{"q":"为什么网络要求二次幂 N？","a":"每一级配对都按二进制位组织。非二次幂可补到下一二次幂，升序通常用 +∞ padding，最后裁剪。"},{"q":"双缓冲是否就是最快实现？","a":"它提供清晰的数据依赖，但每轮多了一次共享内存复制。性能版可设计缓冲交替或 warp 级网络，仍必须保持正确同步。"},{"q":"如何改成按值排序并输出原始索引？","a":"给每个元素携带 index，在比较时同时交换 value/index；如需稳定性，比较器还要把 index 作为 tie breaker。"}],"checklist":["测试 N=1、含重复值、负数、已经有序与逆序行。","逐阶段确认源缓冲不会被当前阶段覆盖。","将输出与完整 torch.sort 结果比较，再检查单调性。"],"blanks":[{"prompt":"当前阶段写 b 时，a 应保持什么访问模式？","answer":"只读","hint":"所有线程要读取同一阶段的旧快照。"},{"prompt":"b 复制回 a 后，下一轮读取 a 前需要什么？","answer":"T.sync_threads()","hint":"确保所有线程完成覆盖写入。"}],"references":[{"label":"TileLang 官方：Instructions","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/docs/programming_guides/instructions.md"},{"label":"TileLang 官方：Language Basics","url":"https://www.tilelang.com/programming_guides/language_basics.html"},{"label":"TileLang 官方：公共语言接口","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/tilelang/language/common.py"}]},{"id":"P18","module":"M8","title":"Per-row INT8 Quantization","subtitle":"逐行 absmax、对称量化与 ties-to-even","difficulty":"进阶","minutes":40,"tags":["INT8","Quantization","归约","Rounding"],"statement":"实现逐行对称 INT8 量化。每行 scale 由最大绝对值决定；量化范围使用 [-127,127]，zero point 为零。全零行规定 scale=1、量化值全零。舍入使用最近偶数规则，避免把 float→int 的截断误认为 rounding。","formula":"a=maxn |X[m,n]|；s=1 if a=0 else a/127；Q=clip(round_to_even(X/s),−127,127)；反量化近似 X̂=Q·s","inputs":"X:[M,N] FP32，同一 CUDA 设备上的连续 row-major 张量。","outputs":"Q:[M,N] int8，Scale:[M] FP32；zero point 固定为 0。","constraints":["M>0，1≤N≤4096。","输入为有限数；非零行的 absmax 限于 [1e−30,1e30]，避免极端 scale 下溢或溢出问题。","采用对称范围 [-127,127]，保留 -128 不使用；量化约定需与下游算子一致。","ties-to-even 作用于实际 FP32 归一化值；边界附近还受除法精度影响。","Python 语法已检查；未进行 GPU 编译、正确性和性能验证。"],"approach":["并行取绝对值，padding 填零，用 reduce_max 得到每行 absmax。","全零行 scale=1，其余为 absmax/127；一个 block 只写一个 scale。","先求归一化值的 floor 和小数部分：小于 0.5 取 floor，大于 0.5 取 floor+1，等于 0.5 时选择偶数。","先将整数结果裁剪到 [-127,127]，再转换为 int8，避免溢出回绕。","测试除了随机行，还要显式构造零行与 scale=1 的正负 half-way case；后续可比较量化和反量化误差。"],"mapping":[{"cuda":"逐行 absmax reduction","tilelang":"T.Parallel + T.reduce_max","why":"整行共用同一个动态 scale。"},{"cuda":"round-to-nearest-even 转整数","tilelang":"T.floor + 小数比较 + 偶数判断","why":"明确舍入规则，避免依赖某个未说明的 round/cast 约定。"},{"cuda":"saturate 后写 int8","tilelang":"T.min/T.max 裁剪后 T.cast(...,\"int8\")","why":"先限定整数范围再做窄类型转换。"}],"versions":[{"name":"v0 · 逐行对称 INT8","note":"完整 scale 与量化输出，含零行和正负中点测试。Python 语法已检查，GPU 编译和运行待验证。","code":"import torch\nimport tilelang\nimport tilelang.language as T\n\n\ndef make_row_int8_quant(M, N):\n    assert M > 0 and 1 <= N <= 4096\n    BN = 1 << (N - 1).bit_length()\n\n    @T.prim_func\n    def main(\n        X: T.Tensor((M, N), \"float32\"),\n        Q: T.Tensor((M, N), \"int8\"),\n        Scale: T.Tensor((M,), \"float32\"),\n    ):\n        with T.Kernel(M, threads=128) as row:\n            abs_x = T.alloc_fragment((BN,), \"float32\")\n            amax = T.alloc_fragment((1,), \"float32\")\n            scale = T.alloc_fragment((1,), \"float32\")\n            for col in T.Parallel(BN):\n                if col < N:\n                    abs_x[col] = T.abs(X[row, col])\n                else:\n                    abs_x[col] = 0.0\n            T.reduce_max(abs_x, amax, dim=0, clear=True)\n            for i in T.Parallel(1):\n                scale[i] = T.if_then_else(\n                    amax[i] == 0.0, 1.0, amax[i] / 127.0\n                )\n                Scale[row] = scale[i]\n\n            for col in T.Parallel(BN):\n                if col < N:\n                    z = X[row, col] / scale[0]\n                    floor_z = T.floor(z)\n                    lo = T.cast(floor_z, \"int32\")\n                    fraction = z - floor_z\n                    # 最近整数；恰好位于中点时选择偶数。\n                    rounded = T.if_then_else(\n                        fraction < 0.5, lo,\n                        T.if_then_else(\n                            fraction > 0.5, lo + 1,\n                            T.if_then_else(lo % 2 == 0, lo, lo + 1),\n                        ),\n                    )\n                    clipped = T.max(-127, T.min(127, rounded))\n                    Q[row, col] = T.cast(clipped, \"int8\")\n\n    return tilelang.compile(main, out_idx=None, target=\"cuda\")\n\n\ndef main():\n    torch.manual_seed(0)\n    M, N = 17, 513\n    x = torch.randn(M, N, device=\"cuda\") * 8.0\n    x[0].zero_()\n    # amax=127 => scale=1；同时检查正负中点的偶数舍入。\n    x[1].zero_()\n    x[1, :8] = torch.tensor(\n        [127.0, 0.5, 1.5, 2.5, -0.5, -1.5, -2.5, -127.0],\n        device=\"cuda\",\n    )\n    q = torch.empty(M, N, device=\"cuda\", dtype=torch.int8)\n    scale = torch.empty(M, device=\"cuda\")\n    make_row_int8_quant(M, N)(x, q, scale)\n\n    amax = x.abs().amax(dim=1)\n    ref_scale = torch.where(amax == 0, torch.ones_like(amax), amax / 127.0)\n    ref_q = torch.round(x / ref_scale[:, None]).clamp(-127, 127).to(torch.int8)\n    torch.testing.assert_close(scale, ref_scale, rtol=1e-6, atol=0)\n    torch.testing.assert_close(q, ref_q, rtol=0, atol=0)\n    assert float(scale[0]) == 1.0\n    print(\"INT8 codes, zero row and ties-to-even checked\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"}],"pitfalls":[{"title":"把 int8 cast 当成四舍五入","body":"浮点转整数通常是截断语义，和最近偶数不同。例如 1.5 要变为 2，2.5 也变为 2。"},{"title":"零行直接使用 absmax/127","body":"得到 scale=0，归一化时产生 0/0。题目规定零行 scale=1。"},{"title":"舍入后直接转换 int8","body":"不经裁剪的窄类型转换可能回绕或产生平台相关结果。先将整数限定到量化范围。"}],"questions":[{"q":"为什么不用 -128？","a":"本题使用零点为零的严格对称范围 [-127,127]。其他框架可能采用不同范围，集成时必须统一约定。"},{"q":"负数的 ties-to-even 如何处理？","a":"先 floor，例如 -1.5 的 floor 是 -2；它已经是偶数，因此选 -2。-2.5 的 floor 是 -3，选择相邻偶数 -2。"},{"q":"逐行量化比整个 tensor 一个 scale 多付出什么？","a":"需要更多 scale、逐行归约和读取 scale 的开销，通常能更贴合不同行的数值范围。最终收益取决于数据分布和下游计算。"}],"checklist":["检查全零行 scale=1 且所有 code 为零。","用 amax=127 的行测试 ±0.5、±1.5、±2.5。","验证范围、dtype、scale 广播方向及反量化误差。"],"blanks":[{"prompt":"全零行的 scale 按本题规定应是多少？","answer":"1.0","hint":"让零输入归一化后仍为零。"},{"prompt":"ties-to-even 下，-2.5 舍入得到多少？","answer":"-2","hint":"两个相邻整数中选择偶数。"}],"references":[{"label":"TileLang 官方：归约 API 源码","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/tilelang/language/reduce_op.py"},{"label":"TileLang 官方：公共语言接口","url":"https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang/blob/main/tilelang/language/common.py"},{"label":"TileLang 官方：Language Basics","url":"https://www.tilelang.com/programming_guides/language_basics.html"}]}];
